<p>In Weeks 19 and 20, only Saturday is hard. Week 20 calories are 100 higher than Week 19 on every day (2,200 training, 1,900 rest).</p>
<h3>Daily targets this phase</h3>
<p><b>Week 18</b> uses the Phase 4 numbers. <b>Week 19</b> returns to 2,100 and 1,800. <b>Week 20</b> is 2,200 and 1,900. None of these weeks is hard to follow: each is a single change to dinner starch.</p>
