 1,700 / 2,400</td><td class="">Tue, Thu*, Sat</td><td class="">Retest</td><td class="num">174.1</td></tr><tr class=""><td class="">19</td><td class="">Feb 8-14</td><td class="">Phase 5</td><td class="">2,100 / 1,800</td><td class="">Sat</td><td class=""></td><td class="num">173.4</td></tr><tr class=""><td class="">20</td><td class="">Feb 15-21</td><td class="">Phase 5</td><td class="">2,200 / 1,900</td><td class="">Sat</td><td class="">Measure</td><td class="num">173.0</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="note">Hard days marked * depend on the recovery check. Start weight: 186 lb. Projected Week 20 average: 173.0 lb, a loss of about 13 lb. A realistic range is 173 to 177 lb.</p>
</section>
<section class="checklists" id="s32">
<h2><span class="n">32</span>Daily Checklists</h2>
<p>Print this page or keep it open on your phone.</p>
<div class="two-col">
<div><h3>Training day</h3>
<ul class="check"><li><span class="box"></span>Weigh in on waking; log it</li><li><span class="box"></span>Breakfast: 3 eggs, 2 slices Ezekiel, 200 g berries (or Option B)</li><li><span class="box"></span>Lunch: 120 g chicken, 180 g rice, 250 g vegetables, weighed</li><li><span class="box"></span>3:30 PM snack: 200 g cottage cheese and an apple (or Option B)</li><li><span class="box"></span>6:45 PM electrolytes</li><li><span class="box"></span>7:30 PM CrossFit at today's RPE</li><li><span class="box"></span>Shake: 45 g whey and 5 g creatine</li><li><span class="box"></span>Dinner: 90 g chicken, 200 g rice, 250 g vegetables, weighed</li><li><span class="box"></span>Calories within 100 of target; protein 140 g or more</li><li><span class="box"></span>7,000 steps; about 100 oz fluids</li><li><span class="box"></span>Multivitamin</li><li><span class="box"></span>Lights out on time</li></ul>
</div><div><h3>Rest day</h3>
<ul class="check"><li><span class="box"></span>Weigh in on waking; log it</li><li><span class="box"></span>Breakfast: 3 eggs, 1 slice Ezekiel, 200 g berries (or Option B)</li><li><span class="box"></span>Lunch: 140 g chicken, 100 g rice, 250 g vegetables, weighed</li><li><span class="box"></span>3:30 PM shake: 45 g whey, 5 g creatine, and an apple</li><li><span class="box"></span>Dinner: 130 g chicken, 200 g potato, 250 g vegetables, weighed</li><li><span class="box"></span>30 to 45 minute walk</li><li><span class="box"></span>Calories within 100 of target; protein 140 g or more</li><li><span class="box"></span>7,000 steps; about 100 oz fluids</li><li><span class="box"></span>Multivitamin</li><li><span class="box"></span>Lights out on time</li><li><span class="box"></span>Sunday only: check-in (Section 22)</li></ul>
</div></div>
<p class="note">Portions shown are the Weeks 1 to 12 base plan. Phase pages list the changes for later weeks.</p>
</section>
<section class="refs-sec" id="refs">
<h2>References</h2>
<ol class="refs"><li id="ref-1">Hall KD, Heymsfield SB, Kemnitz JW, Klein S, Schoeller DA, Speakman JR. Energy balance and its components: implications for body weight regulation. <i>Am J Clin Nutr</i>. 2012;95(4):989-994.</li><li id="ref-2">Theodorakis N, Kreouzi M, Pappas A, Nikolaou M. Beyond calories: individual metabolic and hormonal adaptations driving variability in weight management. A state-of-the-art narrative review. <i>Int J Mol Sci</i>. 2024;25(24):13438.</li><li id="ref-3">Hall KD, Sacks G, Chandramohan D, et al. Quantification of the effect of energy imbalance on bodyweight. <i>Lancet</i>. 2011;378(9793):826-837.</li><li id="ref-4">Westerterp KR. Diet induced thermogenesis. <i>Nutr Metab (Lond)</i>. 2004;1(1):5.</li><li id="ref-5">von Loeffelholz C, Birkenfeld AL. Non-exercise activity thermogenesis in human energy homeostasis. In: Feingold KR, et al., eds. <i>Endotext</i>. MDText.com; updated 2022.</li><li id="ref-6">Levine JA, Eberhardt NL, Jensen MD. Role of nonexercise activity thermogenesis in resistance to fat gain in humans. <i>Science</i>. 1999;283(5399):212-214.</li><li id="ref-7">Levine JA, Lanningham-Foster LM, McCrady SK, et al. Interindividual variation in posture allocation: possible role in human obesity. <i>Science</i>. 2005;307(5709):584-586.</li><li id="ref-8">Saeidifard F, Medina-Inojosa JR, Supervia M, et al. Differences of energy expenditure while sitting versus standing: a systematic review and meta-analysis. <i>Eur J Prev Cardiol</i>. 2018;25(5):522-538.</li><li id="ref-9">Levine JA, Vander Weg MW, Hill JO, Klesges RC. Non-exercise activity thermogenesis: the crouching tiger hidden dragon of societal weight gain. <i>Arterioscler Thromb Vasc Biol</i>. 2006;26(4):729-736.</li><li id="ref-10">Metabolic consequences of weight reduction. <i>StatPearls</i> [Internet]. Treasure Island (FL): StatPearls Publishing; updated July 2026. NBK572145.</li><li id="ref-11">Rosenbaum M, Leibel RL. Adaptive thermogenesis in humans. <i>Int J Obes (Lond)</i>. 2010;34(Suppl 1):S47-S55.</li><li id="ref-12">Sumithran P, Prendergast LA, Delbridge E, et al. Long-term persistence of hormonal adaptations to weight loss. <i>N Engl J Med</i>. 2011;365(17):1597-1604.</li><li id="ref-13">Fothergill E, Guo J, Howard L, et al. Persistent metabolic adaptation 6 years after "The Biggest Loser" competition. <i>Obesity (Silver Spring)</i>. 2016;24(8):1612-1619.</li><li id="ref-14">Careau V, Halsey LG, Pontzer H, et al. Energy compensation and adiposity in humans. <i>Curr Biol</i>. 2021;31(20):4659-4666.</li><li id="ref-15">Byrne NM, Sainsbury A, King NA, Hills AP, Wood RE. Intermittent energy restriction improves weight loss efficiency in obese men: the MATADOR study. <i>Int J Obes (Lond)</i>. 2018;42(2):129-138.</li><li id="ref-16">Campbell BI, Aguilar D, Colenso-Semple LM, et al. Intermittent energy restriction attenuates the loss of fat free mass in resistance trained individuals. A randomized controlled trial. <i>J Funct Morphol Kinesiol</i>. 2020;5(1):19. See also the published reanalysis and author reply in the same journal, 2020;5(4).</li><li id="ref-17">Novotny JA, Gebauer SK, Baer DJ. Discrepancy between the Atwater factor predicted and empirically measured energy values of almonds in human diets. <i>Am J Clin Nutr</i>. 2012;96(2):296-301.</li><li id="ref-18">Karl JP, Meydani M, Barnett JB, et al. Substituting whole grains for refined grains in a 6-wk randomized trial favorably affects energy-balance metrics in healthy men and postmenopausal women. <i>Am J Clin Nutr</i>. 2017;105(3):589-599.</li><li id="ref-19">Corbin KD, Carnero EA, Dirks B, et al. Host-diet-gut microbiome interactions influence human energy balance: a randomized clinical trial. <i>Nat Commun</i>. 2023;14:3161.</li><li id="ref-20">Arizona State University. Your gut microbes might be turning fiber into extra calories. <i>ScienceDaily</i>. October 24, 2025.</li><li id="ref-21">Hall KD, Ayuketah A, Brychta R, et al. Ultra-processed diets cause excess calorie intake and weight gain: an inpatient randomized controlled trial of ad libitum food intake. <i>Cell Metab</i>. 2019;30(1):67-77.</li><li id="ref-22">Rolls BJ, Roe LS, Meengs JS. Salad and satiety: energy density and portion size of a first-course salad affect energy intake at lunch. <i>J Am Diet Assoc</i>. 2004;104(10):1570-1576.</li><li id="ref-23">Holt SH, Miller JC, Petocz P, Farmakalidis E. A satiety index of common foods. <i>Eur J Clin Nutr</i>. 1995;49(9):675-690.</li><li id="ref-24">Weigle DS, Breen PA, Matthys CC, et al. A high-protein diet induces sustained reductions in appetite, ad libitum caloric intake, and body weight despite compensatory changes in diurnal plasma leptin and ghrelin concentrations. <i>Am J Clin Nutr</i>. 2005;82(1):41-48.</li><li id="ref-25">Miketinas DC, Bray GA, Beyl RA, Ryan DH, Sacks FM, Champagne CM. Fiber intake predicts weight loss and dietary adherence in adults consuming calorie-restricted diets: the POUNDS Lost study. <i>J Nutr</i>. 2019;149(10):1742-1748.</li><li id="ref-26">Lewis SJ, Heaton KW. Stool form scale as a useful guide to intestinal transit time. <i>Scand J Gastroenterol</i>. 1997;32(9):920-924.</li><li id="ref-27">van der Schoot A, Drysdale C, Whelan K, Dimidi E. The effect of fiber supplementation on chronic constipation in adults: an updated systematic review and meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials. <i>Am J Clin Nutr</i>. 2022;116(4):953-969.</li><li id="ref-28">Institute of Medicine. <i>Dietary Reference Intakes for Energy, Carbohydrate, Fiber, Fat, Fatty Acids, Cholesterol, Protein, and Amino Acids</i>. Washington, DC: National Academies Press; 2005.</li><li id="ref-29">Institute of Medicine. <i>Dietary Reference Intakes for Water, Potassium, Sodium, Chloride, and Sulfate</i>. Washington, DC: National Academies Press; 2005.</li><li id="ref-30">Donnelly JE, Blair SN, Jakicic JM, et al. American College of Sports Medicine position stand. Appropriate physical activity intervention strategies for weight loss and prevention of weight regain for adults. <i>Med Sci Sports Exerc</i>. 2009;41(2):459-471.</li><li id="ref-31">Cava E, Yeat NC, Mittendorfer B. Preserving healthy muscle during weight loss. <i>Adv Nutr</i>. 2017;8(3):511-519.</li><li id="ref-32">Wewege M, van den Berg R, Ward RE, Keech A. The effects of high-intensity interval training vs. moderate-intensity continuous training on body composition in overweight and obese adults: a systematic review and meta-analysis. <i>Obes Rev</i>. 2017;18(6):635-646.</li><li id="ref-33">Guo Z, Li M, Cai J, et al. Effect of high-intensity interval training vs. moderate-intensity continuous training on fat loss and cardiorespiratory fitness in the young and middle-aged: a systematic review and meta-analysis. <i>Int J Environ Res Public Health</i>. 2023;20(6):4741.</li><li id="ref-34">Schoenfeld BJ, Ogborn D, Krieger JW. Effects of resistance training frequency on measures of muscle hypertrophy: a systematic review and meta-analysis. <i>Sports Med</i>. 2016;46(11):1689-1697.</li><li id="ref-35">Schoenfeld BJ, Grgic J, Krieger J. How many times per week should a muscle be trained to maximize muscle hypertrophy? A systematic review and meta-analysis of studies examining the effects of resistance training frequency. <i>J Sports Sci</i>. 2019;37(11):1286-1295.</li><li id="ref-36">CrossFit. How often should I do CrossFit? <i>CrossFit Essentials</i>. crossfit.com.</li><li id="ref-37">Pasiakos SM, Cao JJ, Margolis LM, et al. Effects of high-protein diets on fat-free mass and muscle protein synthesis following weight loss: a randomized controlled trial. <i>FASEB J</i>. 2013;27(9):3837-3847.</li><li id="ref-38">Longland TM, Oikawa SY, Mitchell CJ, Devries MC, Phillips SM. Higher compared with lower dietary protein during an energy deficit combined with intense exercise promotes greater lean mass gain and fat mass loss: a randomized trial. <i>Am J Clin Nutr</i>. 2016;103(3):738-746.</li><li id="ref-39">Morton RW, Murphy KT, McKellar SR, et al. A systematic review, meta-analysis and meta-regression of the effect of protein supplementation on resistance training-induced gains in muscle mass and strength in healthy adults. <i>Br J Sports Med</i>. 2018;52(6):376-384.</li><li id="ref-40">Kokura Y, Ueshima J, Saino Y, et al. Enhanced protein intake on maintaining muscle mass, strength, and physical function in adults with overweight/obesity: a systematic review and meta-analysis. <i>Clin Nutr ESPEN</i>. 2024;63:417-426.</li><li id="ref-41">Helms ER, Aragon AA, Fitschen PJ. Evidence-based recommendations for natural bodybuilding contest preparation: nutrition and supplementation. <i>J Int Soc Sports Nutr</i>. 2014;11:20.</li><li id="ref-42">Schoenfeld BJ, Aragon AA. How much protein can the body use in a single meal for muscle-building? Implications for daily protein distribution. <i>J Int Soc Sports Nutr</i>. 2018;15:10.</li><li id="ref-43">Nedeltcheva AV, Kilkus JM, Imperial J, Schoeller DA, Penev PD. Insufficient sleep undermines dietary efforts to reduce adiposity. <i>Ann Intern Med</i>. 2010;153(7):435-441.</li><li id="ref-44">Spiegel K, Tasali E, Penev P, Van Cauter E. Sleep curtailment in healthy young men is associated with decreased leptin levels, elevated ghrelin levels, and increased hunger and appetite. <i>Ann Intern Med</i>. 2004;141(11):846-850.</li><li id="ref-45">Al Khatib HK, Harding SV, Darzi J, Pot GK. The effects of partial sleep deprivation on energy balance: a systematic review and meta-analysis. <i>Eur J Clin Nutr</i>. 2017;71(5):614-624.</li><li id="ref-46">Covassin N, Singh P, McCrady-Spitzer SK, et al. Effects of experimental sleep restriction on energy intake, energy expenditure, and visceral obesity. <i>J Am Coll Cardiol</i>. 2022;79(13):1254-1265.</li><li id="ref-47">Drake C, Roehrs T, Shambroom J, Roth T. Caffeine effects on sleep taken 0, 3, or 6 hours before going to bed. <i>J Clin Sleep Med</i>. 2013;9(11):1195-1200.</li><li id="ref-48">Van Cauter E, Plat L. Physiology of growth hormone secretion during sleep. <i>J Pediatr</i>. 1996;128(5 Pt 2):S32-S37.</li><li id="ref-49">Watson NF, Badr MS, Belenky G, et al. Recommended amount of sleep for a healthy adult: a joint consensus statement of the American Academy of Sleep Medicine and Sleep Research Society. <i>Sleep</i>. 2015;38(6):843-844.</li><li id="ref-50">Lichtman SW, Pisarska K, Berman ER, et al. Discrepancy between self-reported and actual caloric intake and exercise in obese subjects. <i>N Engl J Med</i>. 1992;327(27):1893-1898.</li><li id="ref-51">Burke LE, Wang J, Sevick MA. Self-monitoring in weight loss: a systematic review of the literature. <i>J Am Diet Assoc</i>. 2011;111(1):92-102.</li><li id="ref-52">Zheng Y, Klem ML, Sereika SM, Danford CA, Ewing LJ, Burke LE. Self-weighing in weight management: a systematic literature review. <i>Obesity (Silver Spring)</i>. 2015;23(2):256-265.</li><li id="ref-53">Shcherbina A, Mattsson CM, Waggott D, et al. Accuracy in wrist-worn, sensor-based measurements of heart rate and energy expenditure in a diverse cohort. <i>J Pers Med</i>. 2017;7(2):3.</li><li id="ref-54">Olsson KE, Saltin B. Variation in total body water with muscle glycogen changes in man. <i>Acta Physiol Scand</i>. 1970;80(1):11-18.</li><li id="ref-55">Kreider RB, Kalman DS, Antonio J, et al. International Society of Sports Nutrition position stand: safety and efficacy of creatine supplementation in exercise, sport, and medicine. <i>J Int Soc Sports Nutr</i>. 2017;14:18.</li><li id="ref-56">Garthe I, Raastad T, Refsnes PE, Koivisto A, Sundgot-Borgen J. Effect of two different weight-loss rates on body composition and strength and power-related performance in elite athletes. <i>Int J Sport Nutr Exerc Metab</i>. 2011;21(2):97-104.</li><li id="ref-57">Mifflin MD, St Jeor ST, Hill LA, Scott BJ, Daugherty SA, Koh YO. A new predictive equation for resting energy expenditure in healthy individuals. <i>Am J Clin Nutr</i>. 1990;51(2):241-247.</li><li id="ref-58">Borg GA. Psychophysical bases of perceived exertion. <i>Med Sci Sports Exerc</i>. 1982;14(5):377-381.</li><li id="ref-59">Zourdos MC, Klemp A, Dolan C, et al. Novel resistance training-specific rating of perceived exertion scale measuring repetitions in reserve. <i>J Strength Cond Res</i>. 2016;30(1):267-275.</li><li id="ref-60">U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Research Service. <i>FoodData Central</i>. fdc.nal.usda.gov. Source of all food values in Part Two (rounded).</li><li id="ref-61">Parr EB, Camera DM, Areta JL, et al. Alcohol ingestion impairs maximal post-exercise rates of myofibrillar protein synthesis following a single bout of concurrent training. <i>PLoS One</i>. 2014;9(2):e88384.</li></ol>
<p class="disclaimer">This guide summarizes published research and applies it to one person's stated goals. It is not medical advice. Talk with a physician before starting a new diet or training program, and see a sports medicine physician or physical therapist about any knee symptoms.</p>
</section>
</template>
<script>
(function(){
"use strict";
/* =========================================================
   PLAN DATA (from The Real Equation, final Oct 5 version)
   ========================================================= */
const MEALS = JSON.parse(document.getElementById("meal-data").textContent);
const START_UTC = Date.UTC(2026,9,5);          // Monday, Week 1
const PREP_FROM = -7, LAST = 139, SHOW_LAST = 167; // prep Sep 28, Week 20 ends Feb 21, maintenance to Mar 21
const W0 = 186.0;
const LS_KEY = "rishi-20wk-log-v1", LS_THEME = "rishi-20wk-theme";
const DOW = ["Mon","Tue","Wed","Thu","Fri","Sat","Sun"];
const DOWL = ["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"];
const HOLIDAYS = {
  "2026-11-26":"Thanksgiving",
  "2026-12-25":"Christmas",
  "2026-12-31":"New Year's Eve",
  "2027-01-01":"New Year's Day"
};
const MEASURE_WEEKS = [4,8,12,16,20];
const PHASES = [
  {key:"prep",name:"Prep Week",weeks:[0,0],sec:"s23",goal:"Set up everything so Week 1 is only about execution: app, kitchen, baseline weights, measurements, photos, and benchmarks."},
  {key:"p1",name:"Phase 1: Foundation",weeks:[1,4],sec:"s24",goal:"Build the five-day rhythm, learn to weigh and log accurately, and establish a reliable scale trend."},
  {key:"p2",name:"Phase 2: Build",weeks:[5,8],sec:"s25",goal:"Add a second hard session and a Saturday refeed while the deficit keeps working. Thanksgiving falls in Week 8."},
  {key:"p3",name:"Phase 3: Grind",weeks:[9,12],sec:"s26",goal:"Hold the deficit through the point where adaptation and hunger usually build. Christmas falls in Week 12."},
  {key:"db",name:"Diet Break",weeks:[13,13],sec:"s27",goal:"One full week at maintenance calories over the New Year holiday to let hunger and training quality recover."},
  {key:"p4",name:"Phase 4: Push",weeks:[14,17],sec:"s28",goal:"Resume the deficit at slightly lower targets and train hardest of the whole plan."},
  {key:"p5",name:"Phase 5: Finish",weeks:[18,20],sec:"s29",goal:"Peak and retest in Week 18, then deload and step calories back up toward maintenance."},
  {key:"maint",name:"Finding maintenance",weeks:[21,999],sec:"s30",goal:"Add 100 cal per day each week until your 7-day average holds within about 0.5 lb for two weeks in a row. That intake is your new maintenance."}
];
const VARIANTS = {
  T2100:[], R1800:[],
  T2500:[["Lunch","White rice",330],["Dinner","White rice",350]],
  R2100:[["Lunch","White rice",250],["Afternoon shake","Peanut butter",16]],
  T2000:[["Dinner","White rice",125]],
  R1700:[["Dinner","Potato",75]],
  T2400:[["Lunch","White rice",330],["Dinner","White rice",275]],
  T2200:[["Dinner","White rice",275]],
  R1900:[["Dinner","Potato",300]]
};
const PREP_TASKS = [
  ["app","Set up the app","Cronometer or MacroFactor. Enter 2,100 cal (training) and 1,800 cal (rest), protein target 150 g."],
  ["kitchen","Stock the kitchen","Whey, creatine, eggs, Ezekiel bread, nonfat Greek yogurt, 2% cottage cheese, berries, apples, oats, peanut butter, chicken breast, rice, potatoes, vegetables."],
  ["family","Talk to the family","Ask them to set aside your chicken before sauces go on, and to tell you roughly how much oil goes into each dish."],
  ["practice","Practice weighing","Weigh and log every meal from Wednesday on. This is a dry run."],
  ["weights","Baseline weight","Weigh in every morning Tuesday through Sunday. The average is your starting weight."],
  ["measure","Baseline measurements","Sunday morning: waist at the navel, chest at the nipple line, hips at the widest point, right upper arm mid-bicep (relaxed), right thigh mid-thigh."],
  ["photos","Baseline photos","Front, side, back. Same place, lighting, time of day, and clothing each time."],
  ["bench","Baseline benchmarks","Pick three to retest in Week 18: a benchmark workout your box uses, a 3-rep max on a lift that does not bother the knee, and max strict pull-ups or push-ups."],
  ["coach","Talk to your coach","Explain the RPE plan and the knee history. Confirm the Saturday class time."],
  ["sleep","Set sleep times","Pick a fixed wake time and set a lights-out alarm 8 hours earlier."]
];
const DECISIONS = {
  none:{label:"No change",adj:0},
  add100:{label:"Add 100 cal/day (75 g more rice or 115 g more potato at dinner)",adj:100},
  fixlog:{label:"No target change. Fix the logging and the off days",adj:0},
  slow1:{label:"No change. One slow week is usually water",adj:0},
  walk:{label:"Add 20 minutes of walking every day (about 2,000 steps)",adj:0,steps:2000},
  cut100:{label:"Cut 100 cal/day (75 g less rice or 115 g less potato at dinner)",adj:-100},
  special:{label:"Scheduled change only",adj:0}
};
const SPECIAL = {
  12:"Next week is the diet break: 2,500 training / 2,100 rest. No other change.",
  13:"Diet-break week: no adjustment. Week 14 targets are 2,000 / 1,700. Compare Week 14 with Week 12.",
  18:"Scheduled step-up: Week 19 is 2,100 training / 1,800 rest, no refeed. Do not cut calories.",
  19:"Scheduled step-up: Week 20 is 2,200 training / 1,900 rest. Do not cut calories.",
  20:"After Week 20: add 100 cal/day each week until the average holds for two weeks (guide Section 30)."
};

/* =========================================================
   STATE
   ========================================================= */
let docs = {};
try { docs = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(LS_KEY) || "{}") || {}; } catch(e) { docs = {}; }
if (typeof docs !== "object" || Array.isArray(docs)) docs = {};
const ui = {
  tab:"today", iso:todayIso(), ckWeek:null, prog:"overview", plan:"week", planWeek:null, mealType:null
};
ui.ckWeek = defaultCheckinWeek();
ui.planWeek = clamp(weekOf(idxOf(ui.iso)),0,20);
let col = null, syncMode = "local", firstSync = true, pendingRender = false, downloadsApi = null;
const timers = {};

/* =========================================================
   HELPERS
   ========================================================= */
function pad(n){return String(n).padStart(2,"0")}
function todayIso(){const d=new Date();return d.getFullYear()+"-"+pad(d.getMonth()+1)+"-"+pad(d.getDate())}
function idxOf(iso){const p=iso.split("-").map(Number);return Math.round((Date.UTC(p[0],p[1]-1,p[2])-START_UTC)/864e5)}
function isoOf(i){return new Date(START_UTC+i*864e5).toISOString().slice(0,10)}
function dowOf(i){return ((i%7)+7)%7}
function weekOf(i){ if(i<PREP_FROM) return -1; if(i<0) return 0; return Math.floor(i/7)+1; }
function weekRange(w){ if(w<=0) return [PREP_FROM,-1]; return [(w-1)*7,(w-1)*7+6]; }
function fmtDate(i,o){return new Date(START_UTC+i*864e5).toLocaleDateString("en-US",Object.assign({timeZone:"UTC"},o))}
function fmtLong(i){return fmtDate(i,{weekday:"short",month:"short",day:"numeric"})}
function fmtShort(i){return fmtDate(i,{month:"short",day:"numeric"})}
function rangeLabel(w){const r=weekRange(w);return fmtShort(r[0])+" – "+fmtShort(r[1])}
function clamp(v,a,b){return Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v))}
function num(v){if(v===""||v==null)return null;const x=Number(v);return isFinite(x)?x:null}
function r1(x){return (Math.round(x*10)/10).toFixed(1)}
function comma(x){return Math.round(x).toLocaleString("en-US")}
function esc(s){return String(s==null?"":s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#39;"}[c]))}
function clone(o){return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(o))}
function signed(x,d){if(x==null)return "—";const v=d?r1(x):String(Math.round(x));return (x>0?"+":x<0?"−":"")+v.replace("-","")}
function avg(a){return a.length?a.reduce((s,x)=>s+x,0)/a.length:null}
function phaseOf(w){return PHASES.find(p=>w>=p.weeks[0]&&w<=p.weeks[1])||null}
function uid(){return Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,9)}

/* =========================================================
   DOCS & PERSISTENCE
   ========================================================= */
const TDEF={protFloor:140,protLo:150,protHi:180,tol:100,fiber:30,fluids:100,burnRest:2100,burnTrain:2550,margin:1.5};
const TRACKDEF={sleep:false,energy:false,hunger:false,digestion:false,fluids:false,steps:false,watch:false,routine:true};
function settings(){const s=Object.assign({name:"Rishi",wake:"",lightsOut:"",appUsed:"",favorites:[],maintLock:null,overrides:{},customFoods:[],recipes:[]},docs.settings||{});
  if(!Array.isArray(s.favorites))s.favorites=[];if(!Array.isArray(s.customFoods))s.customFoods=[];if(!Array.isArray(s.recipes))s.recipes=[];if(!s.overrides||typeof s.overrides!=="object")s.overrides={};return s}
function tset(){const t=Object.assign({},TDEF,(docs.settings||{}).targets||{});Object.keys(TDEF).forEach(k=>{if(t[k]==null||!isFinite(t[k]))t[k]=TDEF[k]});return t}
function trk(k){const t=Object.assign({},TRACKDEF,(docs.settings||{}).track||{});return !!t[k]}
function dayKey(iso){return "day-"+iso}
function rawDay(iso){return docs[dayKey(iso)]||null}
function getDay(iso){
  const d = rawDay(iso) ? clone(rawDay(iso)) : {};
  if(d.type==="train") d.type="T"; if(d.type==="rest") d.type="R";
  if(!Array.isArray(d.meals)) d.meals=[];
  if(!Array.isArray(d.sets)) d.sets=[];
  return d;
}
function getWeek(w){return clone(docs["week-"+w]||{})}
function getFinal(){return clone(docs.final||{})}
function touch(key,obj){obj.updatedAt=Date.now();docs[key]=obj;projCache=null;save(key)}
function mutDay(iso,fn){const d=getDay(iso);fn(d);touch(dayKey(iso),d)}
function mutWeek(w,fn){const d=getWeek(w);fn(d);touch("week-"+w,d)}
function mutSettings(fn){const s=clone(docs.settings||{});fn(s);touch("settings",s)}
function mutFinal(fn){const d=getFinal();fn(d);touch("final",d)}
function persistLocal(){try{localStorage.setItem(LS_KEY,JSON.stringify(docs))}catch(e){}}
function save(key){persistLocal();if(!col)return;clearTimeout(timers[key]);timers[key]=setTimeout(()=>push(key),700)}
function push(key,attempt){
  delete timers[key];
  if(!col||!docs[key])return;
  col.doc(key).set(clone(docs[key])).catch(err=>{
    const code=err&&err.code;
    if((code==="unavailable"||code==="resource_exhausted")&&(attempt||0)<4){timers[key]=setTimeout(()=>push(key,(attempt||0)+1),1500*(1+(attempt||0))+Math.random()*1000);return}
    if(code==="invalid_argument"||code==="revoked"||code==="not_granted"||code==="capability_disabled"){goLocal()}
  });
}
function goLocal(){col=null;syncMode="local";updateSync()}

/* =========================================================
   PLAN ENGINE
   ========================================================= */
function weekPlan(w){
  const T=(rpe,extra)=>({type:"T",rpe:rpe,extra:extra||""});
  const R=(extra)=>({type:"R",rpe:"",extra:extra||"30–45 min walk"});
  const F=(rpe)=>({type:"F",rpe:rpe,extra:"Refeed day"});
  const SUN=R("Walk + Sunday check-in");
  if(w<=1) return [T("7"),T("7"),R(),T("7"),T("7"),R(),SUN];
  if(w<=4) return [T("7"),T("7"),R(),T("7"),T("7"),T("8-9"),SUN];
  if(w<=8) return [T("7"),T("8-9"),R(),T("7"),T("7"),F("8-9"),SUN];
  if(w<=12) return [T("7"),T("8-9"),R(),T("8-9*"),T("7"),F("8-9"),SUN];
  if(w===13) return [T("7"),T("8-9"),R(),T("7"),T("7","New Year's Day: if the box is closed, walk 45 min"),T("8-9"),SUN];
  if(w<=18) return [T("7"),T("8-9"),R(),T("8-9*"),T("7"),F("8-9"),SUN];
  return [T("7"),T("7"),R(),T("7"),T("7"),T("8-9"),SUN];
}
function weekNotes(w){
  const n=[];
  if(w===0) n.push("Prep week. Log as a dry run, weigh in each morning from Tuesday, and record your baseline on Sunday.");
  if(w===1) n.push("Week 1 has four sessions. Saturday is a rest day.");
  if((w>=9&&w<=12)||(w>=14&&w<=18)) n.push("Thursday is hard only if last Sunday's recovery check passed. Otherwise RPE 7.");
  if(w===13){n.push("Maintenance week. Every day is eaten at the higher diet-break target. No refeed needed.");n.push("Expect the scale to read 1 to 3 lb higher from stored carbohydrate and water. Ignore it.");}
  if(w===14) n.push("Compare this week's average with Week 12, not Week 13.");
  if(w===18) n.push("Retest your baseline benchmarks this week on your hard days.");
  if(w===19||w===20) n.push("Deload: one hard session only, on Saturday.");
  if(MEASURE_WEEKS.includes(w)) n.push("Measurement week: tape measurements and photos on Sunday morning.");
  if(w===8) n.push("Thanksgiving is Thursday. Holiday-day rule: about 2,500 cal, protein first. If the box is closed, walk 45 minutes.");
  if(w===12) n.push("Christmas is Friday. Holiday-day rule: about 2,500 cal, protein first. If the box is closed, walk 45 minutes.");
  if(w===13) n.push("New Year's Eve is Thursday and New Year's Day is Friday: holiday-day rule for both.");
  if(w>=21) n.push("Finding maintenance: targets rise 100 cal/day each week until your average holds for two weeks. Lock them in on Plan > Calendar.");
  return n;
}
function baseTargets(w){
  if(w<=12) return {train:2100,rest:1800,refeed:w>=5?2500:null,tkey:"T2100",rkey:"R1800",fkey:w>=5?"T2500":null};
  if(w===13) return {train:2500,rest:2100,refeed:null,tkey:"T2500",rkey:"R2100",fkey:null};
  if(w<=18) return {train:2000,rest:1700,refeed:2400,tkey:"T2000",rkey:"R1700",fkey:"T2400"};
  if(w===19) return {train:2100,rest:1800,refeed:null,tkey:"T2100",rkey:"R1800",fkey:null};
  if(w===20) return {train:2200,rest:1900,refeed:null,tkey:"T2200",rkey:"R1900",fkey:null};
  const lock=settings().maintLock; const k=(lock&&lock>=21?Math.min(w,lock):w)-20;
  return {train:2200+100*k,rest:1900+100*k,refeed:null,tkey:"T2200",rkey:"R1900",fkey:null,maint:true};
}
function adjUpTo(w){ // cumulative check-in adjustments from weeks before w
  let cal=0,steps=0;
  for(let k=1;k<w&&k<=30;k++){const d=(docs["week-"+k]||{}).decision;if(d&&DECISIONS[d]){cal+=DECISIONS[d].adj;steps+=DECISIONS[d].steps||0}}
  return {cal,steps};
}
function weekTargets(w){
  const t=Object.assign({},baseTargets(Math.max(w,1)));
  if(w<=0){t.practice=true;return t}
  const a=adjUpTo(w);
  t.adj=a.cal; t.stepGoal=7000+a.steps;
  if(a.cal){
    t.train+=a.cal; t.rest+=a.cal; if(t.refeed) t.refeed+=a.cal;
    t.floorHit = t.train<1900 || t.rest<1600;
    t.train=Math.max(1900,t.train); t.rest=Math.max(1600,t.rest);
  }
  t.plan={train:t.train,rest:t.rest,refeed:t.refeed};
  const ov=settings().overrides[w];
  if(ov){["train","rest","refeed"].forEach(k=>{const v=num(ov[k]);if(v!=null&&v>0){t[k]=v;t.custom=true}})}
  t.belowFloor = t.train<1900 || t.rest<1600;
  return t;
}
let projCache=null;
function projections(){
  if(projCache) return projCache;
  const T=tset(), W=startWeight(), out={0:W}; let wt=W;
  for(let w=1;w<=24;w++){
    const t=weekTargets(w), lost=W-wt, bt=T.burnTrain-7*lost, br=T.burnRest-7*lost; let def=0;
    weekPlan(w).forEach(d=>{def+= d.type==="R" ? br-t.rest : bt-(d.type==="F"?(t.refeed||t.train):t.train)});
    wt-=def/3500; out[w]=Math.round(wt*10)/10;
  }
  projCache=out; return out;
}
function projW(w){return projections()[w]}
function onTrackAt(w){return projW(w)+tset().margin}
function planDay(i){const w=weekOf(i);return weekPlan(Math.max(w,0))[dowOf(i)]}
function recoveryCheck(w){
  const s=weekStats(w);
  const items=[];
  if(trk("sleep")) items.push(["Average sleep 7 h or more", s.avgSleep!=null&&s.avgSleep>=7, s.avgSleep!=null?r1(s.avgSleep)+" h":"not logged"]);
  if(trk("energy")) items.push(["Average energy 3 or more", s.avgEnergy!=null&&s.avgEnergy>=3, s.avgEnergy!=null?r1(s.avgEnergy):"not logged"]);
  items.push(["No knee or joint pain", !s.kneePain, s.kneePain?"pain logged":"none logged"]);
  items.push(["Every scheduled session completed", s.done>=s.planned, s.done+" of "+s.planned]);
  const skipped=[!trk("sleep")?"sleep":null,!trk("energy")?"energy":null].filter(Boolean);
  return {items,pass:items.every(x=>x[1]),skipped};
}
function rpeTxt(r){return String(r||"").replace("-","–")}
function rpeTarget(i){
  const p=planDay(i);
  if(p.rpe!=="8-9*") return {rpe:p.rpe,cond:false};
  const w=weekOf(i), rc=recoveryCheck(w-1);
  return {rpe:rc.pass?"8-9":"7",cond:true,pass:rc.pass};
}
function dayType(i,d){return (d&&d.type)||planDay(i).type}
function targetFor(i,d){
  d=d||getDay(isoOf(i));
  const w=weekOf(i); if(w<0) return {cal:null,type:dayType(i,d),label:"Before the plan"};
  const t=weekTargets(w); let type=dayType(i,d); let missed=false;
  if(d.session==="missed"&&(type==="T"||type==="F")){missed=true}
  let eff=missed?"R":type;
  let cal=eff==="T"?t.train:eff==="F"?(t.refeed||t.train):t.rest;
  let key=eff==="T"?t.tkey:eff==="F"?(t.fkey||t.tkey):t.rkey;
  let label=(eff==="T"?"Training day":eff==="F"?"Refeed day":"Rest day");
  if(missed) label="Missed session: rest-day target";
  const hol=HOLIDAYS[isoOf(i)];
  if(hol&&w>=1){cal=Math.max(2500,cal);label=hol+": holiday-day rule"}
  if(t.practice) label="Prep week practice target";
  return {cal,type,eff,key,label,holiday:hol,practice:!!t.practice,missed};
}
function variantMeals(key,eff){
  const base=MEALS[eff==="R"?"R":"T"]; const ch=VARIANTS[key]||[];
  return base.map(m=>{
    const opts=m.opts.map((o,oi)=>{
      let foods=o.foods.map(f=>f.slice());
      if(oi===0){
        ch.filter(c=>c[0]===m.meal).forEach(c=>{
          const row=foods.find(f=>f[0].indexOf(c[1])===0);
          if(row){const q=parseFloat(row[1]);const k=c[2]/q;row[1]=c[2]+" g";for(let j=2;j<6;j++)row[j]=Math.round(row[j]*k)}
          else if(c[1]==="Peanut butter"){foods.splice(1,0,["Peanut butter",c[2]+" g (1 tbsp)",94,4,3,8])}
        });
      }
      const tot=[0,0,0,0];foods.forEach(f=>{for(let j=0;j<4;j++)tot[j]+=f[j+2]});
      return {name:o.name,foods,total:tot,changed:oi===0&&ch.some(c=>c[0]===m.meal)};
    });
    return {meal:m.meal,time:m.time,opts};
  });
}

/* =========================================================
   STATS
   ========================================================= */
function totals(d){const t={cal:0,p:0,c:0,f:0,fib:0,anyFib:false};(d.meals||[]).forEach(m=>{t.cal+=m.cal||0;t.p+=m.p||0;t.c+=m.c||0;t.f+=m.f||0;if(m.fib!=null){t.fib+=m.fib;t.anyFib=true}});return t}
function inBed(d){
  if(!d.lightsOut||!d.wake) return null;
  const a=d.lightsOut.split(":").map(Number), b=d.wake.split(":").map(Number);
  let m=(b[0]*60+b[1])-(a[0]*60+a[1]); if(m<=0) m+=1440; return m/60;
}
function sleepHours(d){return d.sleep!=null?d.sleep:inBed(d)}
function weightAt(i){const d=rawDay(isoOf(i));return d&&d.weight!=null&&d.weight!==""?Number(d.weight):null}
function avgRange(a,b){const v=[];for(let i=a;i<=b;i++){const w=weightAt(i);if(w!=null)v.push(w)}return avg(v)}
function weekStats(w){
  const r=weekRange(w); const s={w,weights:[],logged:0,within:0,prot:0,done:0,planned:0,hard:0,sleeps:[],energies:[],steps:[],kneePain:false,cals:[],prots:[],fluids:[]};
  for(let i=r[0];i<=r[1];i++){
    const iso=isoOf(i), raw=rawDay(iso), p=planDay(i);
    if(p.type!=="R"&&w>=1) s.planned++;
    if(!raw) continue;
    const d=getDay(iso);
    if(d.weight!=null&&d.weight!=="") s.weights.push(Number(d.weight));
    if(d.meals.length){
      const t=totals(d), tg=targetFor(i,d);
      s.logged++; s.cals.push(t.cal); s.prots.push(t.p);
      if(tg.cal!=null&&Math.abs(t.cal-tg.cal)<=tset().tol) s.within++;
      if(t.p>=tset().protFloor) s.prot++;
    }
    if(d.session==="done"){s.done++; if(d.rpe>=8) s.hard++;}
    const sh=sleepHours(d); if(sh!=null) s.sleeps.push(sh);
    if(d.energy!=null) s.energies.push(d.energy);
    if(d.steps!=null) s.steps.push(d.steps);
    if(d.fluids!=null) s.fluids.push(d.fluids);
    if(d.knee==="N") s.kneePain=true;
  }
  s.avgW=s.weights.length?avg(s.weights):null;
  s.avgSleep=avg(s.sleeps); s.avgEnergy=avg(s.energies); s.avgSteps=avg(s.steps);
  s.avgCal=avg(s.cals); s.avgP=avg(s.prots);
  s.days=r[1]-r[0]+1;
  return s;
}
function compareWeek(w){return w===14?12:w-1}
function weekChange(w){
  const a=weekStats(w), b=weekStats(compareWeek(w));
  if(a.weights.length<3||b.weights.length<3) return {change:null,a,b};
  return {change:a.avgW-b.avgW,a,b};
}
function isSlowGood(w){
  if(w<1||w===13||w>20) return false;
  const c=weekChange(w); if(c.change==null) return false;
  const good=c.a.logged===7&&(7-c.a.within)<=1;
  return good && -c.change<0.5;
}
function slowStreak(w){
  let n=0,k=w;
  while(k>=1){
    if(k===13){k--;continue}
    if(!isSlowGood(k)) break;
    n++;
    const prev=k===14?12:k-1; if(prev>=1&&((docs["week-"+prev]||{}).decision==="cut100")) break;
    k=prev;
  }
  return n;
}
function suggestDecision(w){
  if(w<1) return {key:null,why:"Decisions start in Week 1."};
  if(SPECIAL[w]) return {key:"special",why:SPECIAL[w]};
  if(w>20) return {key:null,why:"Finding maintenance: if your 7-day average has held within about 0.5 lb for two weeks, lock in this week's targets as maintenance."};
  const c=weekChange(w);
  if(c.change==null) return {key:null,why:"Need at least 3 morning weigh-ins this week and in Week "+compareWeek(w)+" to compare averages."};
  const loss=-c.change, good=c.a.logged===7&&(7-c.a.within)<=1;
  if(loss>=0.5&&loss<=1.5) return {key:"none",why:"Lost "+r1(loss)+" lb. Right on plan."};
  if(loss>1.5){
    if(w<3) return {key:"none",why:"Lost "+r1(loss)+" lb, but Weeks 1 and 2 never add calories for fast loss. The first drop is partly water."};
    if(!good) return {key:"fixlog",why:"Lost "+r1(loss)+" lb, but adherence wasn't good enough to trust the numbers."};
    return {key:"add100",why:"Lost "+r1(loss)+" lb with good adherence. That's faster than needed."};
  }
  if(!good) return {key:"fixlog",why:(loss<0?"Gained "+r1(-loss):"Lost only "+r1(loss))+" lb, and adherence wasn't good ("+c.a.logged+"/7 days logged, "+(7-c.a.within)+" off target)."};
  const n=slowStreak(w);
  if(n<=1) return {key:"slow1",why:"Slow week ("+signed(c.change,1)+" lb). One slow week is usually water."};
  if(n===2) return {key:"walk",why:"Second slow week in a row with good adherence."};
  const t=weekTargets(w+1);
  return {key:"cut100",why:"Third slow week in a row with good adherence."+(t.train-100<1900||t.rest-100<1600?" You're at a calorie floor: take a one-week diet break at Week 13 targets instead, then reassess.":"")};
}
function currentWeek(){return weekOf(idxOf(todayIso()))}
function defaultCheckinWeek(){
  const i=idxOf(todayIso()), w=weekOf(i);
  if(w<=0) return 0;
  // Sunday or later in the week → this week; Mon–Sat early → last week
  return clamp(dowOf(i)===6?w:Math.max(w-1,0),0,24);
}
function startWeight(){const b=weekStats(0);return b.weights.length?b.avgW:W0}

/* =========================================================
   RENDER CORE
   ========================================================= */
const app=document.getElementById("app");
const live={};
function render(){
  pendingRender=false;
  const y=window.scrollY;
  document.querySelectorAll("nav.tabs button").forEach(b=>b.setAttribute("aria-current",b.dataset.tab===ui.tab?"page":"false"));
  let html="";
  try{
    html = ui.tab==="today"?viewToday(): ui.tab==="train"?viewTrain(): ui.tab==="progress"?viewProgress(): ui.tab==="plan"?viewPlan(): viewGuide();
  }catch(err){
    html=`<div class="card"><h2>Something went wrong drawing this screen</h2><p class="muted small">${esc(err&&err.message)}</p><button class="btn" data-act="go-tab" data-v="today">Back to Today</button></div>`;
    if(window.console) console.error(err);
  }
  app.innerHTML=html;
  if(ui.tab==="guide") mountGuide();
  refreshLive();
  window.scrollTo(0,y);
}
function scheduleRender(){
  const a=document.activeElement;
  if(a&&app.contains(a)&&/^(INPUT|TEXTAREA|SELECT)$/.test(a.tagName)){pendingRender=true;return}
  render();
}
function refreshLive(){
  app.querySelectorAll("[data-live]").forEach(el=>{const f=live[el.dataset.live];if(f){try{el.innerHTML=f(el)}catch(e){}}});
}
function syncBadge(){return `<span class="sync ${syncMode==="cloud"?"on":""}" id="syncbadge"><i></i>${syncMode==="cloud"?"Synced":"On this device"}</span>`}
function updateSync(){const el=document.getElementById("syncbadge");if(el)el.outerHTML=syncBadge()}
function seg(act,val,opts,extra){return `<div class="seg" role="group">${opts.map(o=>`<button type="button" data-act="${act}" data-v="${o[0]}" ${extra||""} aria-pressed="${String(val)===String(o[0])}">${o[1]}</button>`).join("")}</div>`}
function chips(bind,val,values,labels,kind){return `<div class="chiprow">${values.map((v,k)=>`<button type="button" class="chip" data-act="setv" data-bind="${bind}" data-v="${v}" data-kind="${kind||"num"}" aria-pressed="${val!=null&&String(val)===String(v)}">${labels?labels[k]:v}</button>`).join("")}</div>`}
function field(label,bind,val,o){o=o||{};return `<div class="fld ${o.cls||""}"><label>${label}</label><input class="inp" data-bind="${bind}" ${o.week!=null?`data-week="${o.week}"`:""} type="${o.type||"number"}" ${o.type&&o.type!=="number"?"":`inputmode="${o.im||"decimal"}"`} ${o.step?`step="${o.step}"`:""} placeholder="${esc(o.ph||"")}" value="${esc(val==null?"":val)}"></div>`}
function dateNav(i){
  const w=weekOf(i), ph=phaseOf(w), isToday=isoOf(i)===todayIso();
  const wl = w<0?"Before the plan": w===0?"Prep week": w<=20?"Week "+w+" of 20": "Week "+w+" · after the plan";
  return `<div class="dnav">
    <button class="arrow" data-act="prev" aria-label="Previous day">‹</button>
    <div class="dmid"><div class="dtitle">${fmtLong(i)}</div><div class="dsub">${wl}${ph&&w>=1?` · ${esc(ph.name.replace(/^Phase \d: /,""))}`:""}</div></div>
    <button class="arrow" data-act="next" aria-label="Next day">›</button>
  </div>
  <div class="dline">${isToday?`<span class="muted small">Today</span>`:`<button class="linkbtn" data-act="today">Jump to today</button>`}${syncBadge()}</div>`;
}

/* =========================================================
   TODAY
   ========================================================= */
function viewToday(){
  const iso=ui.iso, i=idxOf(iso), w=weekOf(i), d=getDay(iso), tg=targetFor(i,d), p=planDay(i), wt=weekTargets(Math.max(w,0));
  const type=tg.type, rt=rpeTarget(i);
  let banners="";
  if(w<0) banners+=`<div class="banner calm">This day is before the plan. Prep week starts Monday, Sep 28.</div>`;
  if(tg.holiday&&w>=1) banners+=`<div class="banner">${esc(tg.holiday)}: aim for about 2,500 calories. Eat the protein first at each meal, log your best estimate, and return to the plan tomorrow. Don't undereat tomorrow to make up for it.</div>`;
  if(w===0) banners+=`<div class="banner calm">Prep week tasks and baseline live in <button class="linkbtn" data-act="go-prog" data-v="baseline">Progress › Baseline</button>.</div>`;
  if(dowOf(i)===6&&w>=1) banners+=`<div class="banner calm">Sunday check-in for Week ${w}. <button class="linkbtn" data-act="ck-goto" data-w="${w}">Open it</button>${MEASURE_WEEKS.includes(w)?" (measurements and photos this morning)":""}</div>`;
  if(wt.floorHit) banners+=`<div class="banner">Your adjustments reached a calorie floor (1,900 training / 1,600 rest). If the trend is flat for two more weeks, take a one-week diet break at Week 13 targets, then reassess.</div>`;
  const notes=weekNotes(w);
  const planLine = type==="R" ? `Rest · ${esc(p.extra||"30–45 min walk")}` : `CrossFit 7:30 PM · RPE ${esc(rpeTxt(rt.rpe))}${rt.cond?(rt.pass?" (recovery check passed)":" (recovery check not passed)"):""}${type==="F"?" · Refeed":""}`;
  const typeOpts=[["T","Training"],["R","Rest"]]; if(wt.refeed||type==="F") typeOpts.push(["F","Refeed"]);
  return `${dateNav(i)}
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="plan-line">${planLine}</div>
    <div class="target"><span class="big">${tg.cal!=null?comma(tg.cal):"—"}</span><span class="tunit">cal</span><span class="tlabel">${esc(tg.label)}${wt.custom&&!tg.holiday?" · your custom target":wt.adj&&!tg.holiday?` · includes ${signed(wt.adj)} from check-ins`:""}${wt.belowFloor&&!tg.holiday?" · below the guide's floor":""}</span></div>
    <div class="subtarget">${subTargetLine(wt)}</div>
  </section>
  ${banners}
  ${notes.length?`<details class="notes"><summary>This week's notes (${notes.length})</summary><ul>${notes.map(n=>`<li>${esc(n)}</li>`).join("")}</ul></details>`:""}
  ${seg("type",type,typeOpts)}

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Morning weigh-in</h2>
    <p class="hint">After the bathroom, before food or water.</p>
    <div class="weighrow">
      <input class="biginp" data-bind="d:weight" type="number" inputmode="decimal" step="0.1" placeholder="—" value="${d.weight??""}" aria-label="Morning weight (lb)"><span class="unit">lb</span>
      <div class="wmeta" data-live="wmeta"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Food</h2>
    <div data-live="food"></div>
    <ul class="entries">${d.meals.map((m,k)=>`<li>
      <div class="en"><span class="enn">${esc(m.name||"Food")}</span><span class="env">${m.cal!=null?comma(m.cal)+" cal":""}${m.p!=null?" · "+Math.round(m.p)+" P":""}${m.c!=null?" · "+Math.round(m.c)+" C":""}${m.f!=null?" · "+Math.round(m.f)+" F":""}${m.fib!=null?" · "+Math.round(m.fib)+" fib":""}</span></div>
      <button class="ib ${isFav(m)?"on":""}" data-act="fav" data-i="${k}" aria-label="Save as quick add">★</button>
      <button class="ib" data-act="del-food" data-i="${k}" aria-label="Remove">✕</button></li>`).join("")}</ul>
    <div class="addgrid">
      <input class="inp span3" id="f-name" placeholder="What you ate (or 'Cronometer total')" autocomplete="off">
      <input class="inp" id="f-cal" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="cal">
      <input class="inp" id="f-p" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="protein g">
      <input class="inp" id="f-c" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="carbs g">
      <input class="inp" id="f-f" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="fat g">
      <input class="inp" id="f-fib" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="fiber g">
      <button class="btn" data-act="add-food">Add</button>
    </div>
    ${settings().favorites.length?`<div class="chiprow wrap">${settings().favorites.map((f,k)=>`<button class="chip" data-act="add-fav" data-i="${k}">+ ${esc(f.name)}</button>`).join("")}</div>`:`<p class="hint">Tap ★ on any entry to make it a one-tap quick add.</p>`}
    <details class="plan-meals" ${ui.estOpen?"open":""} data-det="est"><summary>Estimate a food by weight</summary><div id="estbox">${estimatorHtml()}</div></details>
    <details class="plan-meals"><summary>Add from today's meal plan</summary>${planQuickAdd(tg)}</details>
  </section>

  ${trk("fluids")||trk("steps")?`<section class="card">
    <h2>${trk("fluids")&&trk("steps")?"Fluids and steps":trk("fluids")?"Fluids":"Steps"}</h2>
    <div class="${trk("fluids")&&trk("steps")?"grid2":""}">
      ${trk("fluids")?`<div><div data-live="fluids"></div>
        <div class="chiprow"><button class="chip" data-act="fluid" data-v="8">+8 oz</button><button class="chip" data-act="fluid" data-v="16">+16 oz</button><button class="chip" data-act="fluid" data-v="-8">−8</button></div></div>`:""}
      ${trk("steps")?`<div><div data-live="steps"></div>${field("Steps","d:steps",d.steps,{im:"numeric"})}</div>`:""}
    </div>
  </section>`:""}

  ${trk("sleep")||trk("energy")||trk("hunger")||trk("digestion")?`<section class="card">
    <h2>${trk("sleep")?"Sleep and recovery":"How you feel"}</h2>
    ${trk("sleep")?`<p class="hint">Last night. Target: 7.5 h in bed, same wake time every day${settings().wake?" ("+esc(settings().wake)+")":""}.</p>
    <div class="grid2">
      ${field("Lights out","d:lightsOut",d.lightsOut,{type:"time"})}
      ${field("Wake","d:wake",d.wake,{type:"time"})}
    </div>
    <div class="grid2">${field("Hours actually slept","d:sleep",d.sleep,{step:"0.25",ph:"optional"})}<div class="live-hint" data-live="inbed"></div></div>`:""}
    ${trk("energy")?`<label class="lab">Energy (1 exhausted · 3 normal · 5 excellent)</label>${chips("d:energy",d.energy,[1,2,3,4,5])}`:""}
    ${trk("hunger")?`<label class="lab">Hunger (1 not hungry · 3 normal · 5 hard to stay on plan)</label>${chips("d:hunger",d.hunger,[1,2,3,4,5])}`:""}
    ${trk("digestion")?`<label class="lab">Digestion, Bristol type of first stool (0 = none)</label>${chips("d:digestion",d.digestion,[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7]).replace('class="chiprow"','class="chiprow eight"')}
    <p class="hint">1–2 slow · 3–4 normal · 5 soft · 6–7 fast</p>`:""}
  </section>`:""}

  ${trk("routine")?`<section class="card">
    <h2>Routine</h2>
    ${check("d:creatine",d.creatine,"Creatine 5 g","In the shake")}
    ${check("d:multi",d.multi,"Centrum Men's multivitamin","")}
    ${type!=="R"?check("d:lytes",d.lytes,"Electrolytes","6:45 PM, 45 min before class")+check("d:shake",d.shake,"Post-workout shake","45 g whey + 5 g creatine, 8:30–9:00 PM"):check("d:walk",d.walk,"Rest-day walk","30–45 minutes, after dinner works well")}
    ${trk("sleep")?check("d:onTime",d.onTime,"Lights out on time",settings().lightsOut?"Target "+esc(settings().lightsOut):"8 hours before your wake time"):""}
    ${type!=="R"?`<p class="hint">Log the session itself on the <button class="linkbtn" data-act="go-tab" data-v="train">Train</button> tab.</p>`:""}
  </section>`:""}

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Today's checklist</h2>
    <div data-live="checklist"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>Notes</h2>
    <textarea class="inp" data-bind="d:notes" rows="3" placeholder="Hunger, energy, knee, anything off plan">${esc(d.notes||"")}</textarea>
  </section>`;
}
function subTargetLine(wt){
  const P=tset(), parts=[`Protein ${P.protLo}–${P.protHi} g, never below ${P.protFloor}`];
  if(trk("steps")) parts.push(`Steps ${comma(wt.stepGoal||7000)}+`);
  if(trk("fluids")) parts.push(`Fluids ~${P.fluids} oz`);
  return parts.join(" · ");
}
function check(bind,val,label,sub,week){
  return `<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="${bind}" ${week!=null?`data-week="${week}"`:""} ${val?"checked":""}><span>${label}${sub?`<span class="sub">${sub}</span>`:""}</span></label>`;
}
function planQuickAdd(tg){
  if(!tg.key) return `<p class="hint">No meal plan for this day.</p>`;
  const meals=variantMeals(tg.key,tg.eff);
  return meals.map((m,mi)=>`<div class="pqa"><div class="pqh">${esc(m.meal)} <span class="muted">${esc(m.time)}</span></div>
    ${m.opts.map((o,oi)=>`<button class="pqb" data-act="add-plan" data-m="${mi}" data-o="${oi}">
      <span><b>${m.opts.length>1?(oi?"B":"A")+": ":""}${esc(o.name)}</b>${o.changed?" <em>(phase portions)</em>":""}<span class="sub">${esc(o.foods.filter(f=>f[2]>0).map(f=>f[1]+" "+f[0].split(",")[0].toLowerCase()).join(", "))}</span></span>
      <span class="pqv">${comma(o.total[0])}<small> cal · ${o.total[1]} P</small></span></button>`).join("")}</div>`).join("")+
    (tg.holiday?`<p class="hint">Holiday day: these are the regular portions. Eat protein first.</p>`:portionFix((tg.cal||0)-meals.reduce((a,m)=>a+m.opts[0].total[0],0)));
}
function isFav(m){return settings().favorites.some(f=>f.name===m.name&&f.cal===m.cal&&f.p===m.p)}
function gauge(val,target,label,opts){
  opts=opts||{};
  const max=opts.max||(target?target*1.2:Math.max(val,1));
  const pct=Math.min(100,val/max*100);
  const over=opts.overBad&&target&&val>target+(opts.tol!=null?opts.tol:100);
  const ok=opts.okAt!=null&&val>=opts.okAt;
  return `<div class="gauge"><div class="gtop"><span class="gval">${opts.fmt?opts.fmt(val):comma(val)}${opts.unit?`<small>${opts.unit}</small>`:""}</span><span class="gof">${label}</span></div>
  <div class="bar">${opts.zone?`<i class="zone" style="left:${opts.zone[0]/max*100}%;width:${(opts.zone[1]-opts.zone[0])/max*100}%"></i>`:""}<i class="fill ${over?"over":ok?"ok":""}" style="width:${pct}%"></i>${opts.tick!=null?`<i class="tick" style="left:${Math.min(100,opts.tick/max*100)}%"></i>`:""}</div></div>`;
}
live.food=function(){
  const i=idxOf(ui.iso), d=getDay(ui.iso), t=totals(d), tg=targetFor(i,d);
  const P=tset();
  let calLbl = tg.cal!=null ? `of ${comma(tg.cal)} · ${Math.abs(tg.cal-t.cal)<=P.tol?"on target":(t.cal<tg.cal?comma(tg.cal-t.cal)+" left":comma(t.cal-tg.cal)+" over")}` : "cal";
  return gauge(t.cal,tg.cal,calLbl,{max:tg.cal?tg.cal*1.25:3000,unit:" cal",overBad:true,tol:P.tol,zone:tg.cal?[tg.cal-P.tol,tg.cal+P.tol]:null})+
    gauge(t.p,P.protHi,`protein · floor ${P.protFloor}, aim ${P.protLo}–${P.protHi}`,{max:Math.max(P.protHi*1.17,P.protFloor+20),unit:" g",okAt:P.protFloor,zone:[P.protLo,P.protHi],tick:P.protFloor,fmt:v=>Math.round(v)})+
    `<div class="macros"><span><b>${Math.round(t.c)}</b> g carbs</span><span><b>${Math.round(t.f)}</b> g fat</span><span><b>${t.anyFib?Math.round(t.fib):"—"}</b> g fiber <small>(${P.fiber}+)</small></span></div>`;
};
live.wmeta=function(){
  const i=idxOf(ui.iso), a=avgRange(i-6,i), p=avgRange(i-13,i-7), w=weekOf(i);
  let s=`<span>7-day avg</span><b>${a!=null?r1(a):"—"}</b>`;
  if(a!=null&&p!=null){const dd=a-p;s+=`<span class="${dd<=0?"good":"bad"}">${signed(dd,1)} vs prior 7</span>`}
  if(w>=1&&w<=24) s+=`<span class="muted">On track ≤ ${r1(onTrackAt(w))}</span>`;
  return s;
};
live.fluids=function(){const d=getDay(ui.iso),g=tset().fluids;return gauge(d.fluids||0,g,"aim about "+g+" oz",{max:g*1.3,okAt:g,tick:g,unit:" oz"})};
live.steps=function(){const d=getDay(ui.iso),w=weekOf(idxOf(ui.iso)),g=(weekTargets(Math.max(w,0)).stepGoal)||7000;return gauge(d.steps||0,g,"steps · goal "+comma(g),{max:g*1.4,okAt:g,tick:g})};
live.inbed=function(){const d=getDay(ui.iso),b=inBed(d);return b!=null?`In bed <b>${r1(b)} h</b>${b<7.5?"<br>under the 7.5 h target":" ✓"}`:"In bed time appears once both times are set"};
live.checklist=function(){
  const i=idxOf(ui.iso), d=getDay(ui.iso), t=totals(d), tg=targetFor(i,d), w=weekOf(i), g=(weekTargets(Math.max(w,0)).stepGoal)||7000;
  const sh=sleepHours(d);
  const P=tset();
  const items=[
    ["Weighed in", d.weight!=null&&d.weight!==""],
    ["Food logged", d.meals.length>0],
    ["Calories within "+P.tol+" of target", tg.cal!=null&&d.meals.length>0&&Math.abs(t.cal-tg.cal)<=P.tol],
    ["Protein "+P.protFloor+" g or more", t.p>=P.protFloor]];
  if(trk("steps")) items.push(["Steps "+comma(g)+"+", (d.steps||0)>=g]);
  if(trk("fluids")) items.push(["About "+P.fluids+" oz fluids", (d.fluids||0)>=P.fluids]);
  items.push(tg.type==="R"?["30–45 min walk",!!d.walk]:["Session done (log it on Train)",d.session==="done"]);
  if(trk("routine")) items.push(["Creatine and multivitamin",!!(d.creatine&&d.multi)]);
  if(trk("sleep")) items.push(["7.5 h in bed",sh!=null&&sh>=7.5]);
  const n=items.filter(x=>x[1]).length;
  return `<div class="cl-score"><b>${n}</b> of ${items.length}</div><ul class="cl">${items.map(x=>`<li class="${x[1]?"y":""}"><i>${x[1]?"✓":""}</i>${x[0]}</li>`).join("")}</ul>`;
};

/* =========================================================
   TRAIN
   ========================================================= */
function viewTrain(){
  const iso=ui.iso, i=idxOf(iso), w=weekOf(i), d=getDay(iso), tg=targetFor(i,d), p=planDay(i), rt=rpeTarget(i);
  const planned=tg.type!=="R";
  const showLog=planned||d.session==="done"||d.logRest;
  const lifts=liftNames();
  return `${dateNav(i)}
  <section class="hero small">
    <div class="plan-line">${planned?`Planned: CrossFit · RPE ${esc(rpeTxt(rt.rpe))}`:"Planned: rest day"}${p.extra&&planned?" · "+esc(p.extra):""}</div>
    ${rt.cond?`<div class="subtarget">Thursday is conditional. Last week's recovery check ${rt.pass?"passed, so today is hard (RPE 8–9).":"didn't pass (or wasn't logged), so today is RPE 7."}</div>`:""}
    ${!planned?`<div class="subtarget">${esc(p.extra||"30–45 min walk")}</div>`:""}
  </section>
  ${planned?seg("session",d.session||"",[["done","Done"],["missed","Missed"]]):(showLog?"":`<button class="btn ghost full" data-act="log-rest">Log an unplanned session</button>`)}
  ${d.session==="missed"?`<div class="banner calm">Missed session: eat the rest-day target today and take the walk. Don't add a session later in the week.</div>`:""}
  ${showLog&&d.session!=="missed"?`
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Session</h2>
    <div class="${trk("watch")?"grid3":"grid2"}">
      ${field("Start","d:start",d.start||"",{type:"time"})}
      ${field("Minutes","d:duration",d.duration,{im:"numeric"})}
      ${trk("watch")?field("Watch cal","d:burn",d.burn,{im:"numeric"}):""}
    </div>
    <label class="lab">RPE actual (target ${esc(rpeTxt(rt.rpe)||"—")})</label>
    ${chips("d:rpe",d.rpe,[5,6,7,8,9,10])}
    <label class="lab">Knee OK?</label>
    ${chips("d:knee",d.knee,["Y","N"],["Yes, no joint pain","No, joint pain"],"text")}
    ${d.knee==="N"?`<p class="hint warn">Stop that movement and substitute. Note it below and tell your coach. See a PT or sports-medicine doctor for new or worsening symptoms.</p>`:""}
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Strength</h2>
    <p class="hint">${rt.rpe==="8-9"?"Hard day: build to a top set with 1–2 reps left. Never to failure.":"RPE 7: build to a top set you could have done 3 more reps with."}</p>
    <datalist id="liftlist">${lifts.map(l=>`<option value="${esc(l)}">`).join("")}</datalist>
    ${d.sets.length?`<div class="setrow sethead"><span>Lift</span><span>Sets</span><span>Reps</span><span>lb</span><span></span></div>`:""}
    <div class="sets">${d.sets.map((s,k)=>`<div class="setrow">
      <input class="inp lift" list="liftlist" data-bind="set:${k}:lift" placeholder="Lift" value="${esc(s.lift||"")}">
      <input class="inp" data-bind="set:${k}:sets" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="sets" value="${s.sets??""}">
      <input class="inp" data-bind="set:${k}:reps" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="reps" value="${s.reps??""}">
      <input class="inp" data-bind="set:${k}:load" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="lb" value="${s.load??""}">
      <button class="ib" data-act="del-set" data-i="${k}" aria-label="Remove">✕</button></div>`).join("")}</div>
    <div class="grid2"><button class="btn ghost" data-act="add-set">Add a lift</button>${lastSessionWithSets(i)?`<button class="btn ghost" data-act="copy-sets">Copy last session's lifts</button>`:""}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Workout</h2>
    <div class="grid2">${field("Name","d:wodName",d.wodName||"",{type:"text",ph:"e.g. Fran, or 20-min AMRAP"})}
      <div class="fld"><label>Format</label><select class="inp" data-bind="d:wodFormat">${["","For time","AMRAP","EMOM","Intervals","Chipper","Other"].map(o=>`<option ${d.wodFormat===o?"selected":""} value="${o}">${o||"Choose"}</option>`).join("")}</select></div></div>
    <div class="grid2">${field("Score","d:wodScore",d.wodScore||"",{type:"text",ph:"time, rounds + reps, load"})}
      <div class="fld"><label>Scaling</label>${chips("d:wodRx",d.wodRx,["Rx","Scaled"],null,"text")}</div></div>
    <textarea class="inp" data-bind="d:wodNotes" rows="2" placeholder="Movements, substitutions, how it felt">${esc(d.wodNotes||"")}</textarea>
  </section>`:""}
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Week ${w>=0?w:""} schedule</h2>
    ${weekStrip(w)}
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>All 20 weeks</h2>
    ${scheduleGrid()}
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Lift history</h2>
    ${liftHistory()}
  </section>
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Benchmarks</h2>
    ${benchTable()}
    <p class="hint">Record them in <button class="linkbtn" data-act="go-prog" data-v="baseline">Baseline</button> and retest in <button class="linkbtn" data-act="ck-goto" data-w="18">Week 18</button>.</p>
  </section>`;
}
function dayStatus(i){
  const d=rawDay(isoOf(i))?getDay(isoOf(i)):null, p=planDay(i), type=(d&&d.type)||p.type, past=isoOf(i)<todayIso();
  if(d&&d.session==="done") return (d.rpe>=8?"hard":"done");
  if(d&&d.session==="missed") return "missed";
  if(type==="R") return "rest";
  return past?"unlogged":"planned";
}
function weekStrip(w){
  if(w<0) return `<p class="hint">Before the plan.</p>`;
  const r=weekRange(w);
  let out=`<div class="strip">`;
  for(let i=r[0];i<=r[1];i++){
    const p=planDay(i), st=dayStatus(i), d=rawDay(isoOf(i))?getDay(isoOf(i)):{};
    const type=d.type||p.type, rt=rpeTarget(i);
    out+=`<button class="sday st-${st} ${isoOf(i)===ui.iso?"sel":""}" data-act="goto-day" data-iso="${isoOf(i)}">
      <span class="sd">${DOW[dowOf(i)]}</span><span class="sn">${fmtDate(i,{day:"numeric"})}</span>
      <span class="sp">${type==="R"?"Rest":"RPE "+esc(rpeTxt(rt.rpe))}</span><span class="ss">${{hard:"Done · hard",done:"Done",missed:"Missed",rest:"Rest",unlogged:"Not logged",planned:type==="F"?"Refeed":"Planned"}[st]}</span></button>`;
  }
  return out+`</div>`;
}
function scheduleGrid(){
  const cw=currentWeek(); let done=0,planned=0,hard=0;
  let rows="";
  for(let w=0;w<=20;w++){
    const r=weekRange(w);
    let cells="";
    for(let k=0;k<7;k++){
      const i=w===0?-7+k:r[0]+k, st=dayStatus(i);
      if(w>=1&&planDay(i).type!=="R"&&isoOf(i)<=todayIso()){planned++;}
      if(w>=1&&(st==="done"||st==="hard")&&isoOf(i)<=todayIso()){done++;if(st==="hard")hard++}
      cells+=`<button class="gc g-${st} ${isoOf(i)===todayIso()?"today":""}" data-act="goto-day" data-iso="${isoOf(i)}" data-tab="train" aria-label="${fmtLong(i)}: ${st}"></button>`;
    }
    rows+=`<div class="grow ${w===cw?"cur":""}"><span class="gw">${w===0?"P":w}</span>${cells}</div>`;
  }
  return `<div class="gridhead"><span></span>${DOW.map(x=>`<span>${x[0]}</span>`).join("")}</div>${rows}
  <div class="legend2"><span><i class="g-hard"></i>Hard</span><span><i class="g-done"></i>Done</span><span><i class="g-missed"></i>Missed</span><span><i class="g-unlogged"></i>Not logged</span><span><i class="g-planned"></i>Planned</span><span><i class="g-rest"></i>Rest</span></div>
  <p class="small"><b>${done}</b> sessions done of ${planned} planned so far${hard?`, ${hard} at RPE 8+`:""}.</p>`;
}
function allSets(){
  const out=[];
  Object.keys(docs).filter(k=>k.indexOf("day-")===0).sort().forEach(k=>{
    const d=docs[k]; if(!d||!Array.isArray(d.sets)) return;
    d.sets.forEach(s=>{if(s&&s.lift&&String(s.lift).trim()) out.push({iso:k.slice(4),lift:String(s.lift).trim(),sets:num(s.sets),reps:num(s.reps),load:num(s.load)})});
  });
  return out;
}
function liftNames(){const m={};allSets().forEach(s=>{m[s.lift.toLowerCase()]=s.lift});return Object.values(m).sort()}
function lastSessionWithSets(i){for(let k=i-1;k>=i-60;k--){const d=rawDay(isoOf(k));if(d&&Array.isArray(d.sets)&&d.sets.some(s=>s&&s.lift))return k}return null}
function liftHistory(){
  const g={};allSets().forEach(s=>{const key=s.lift.toLowerCase();(g[key]=g[key]||{name:s.lift,rows:[]}).rows.push(s)});
  const names=Object.keys(g).sort();
  if(!names.length) return `<p class="hint">Lifts you log show up here with your best set and estimated 1-rep max.</p>`;
  return `<div class="tw"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Lift</th><th class="num">Best</th><th class="num">Est. 1RM</th><th class="num">Last</th><th class="num">Logged</th></tr></thead><tbody>${names.map(n=>{
    const rows=g[n].rows, withLoad=rows.filter(r=>r.load!=null);
    const best=withLoad.reduce((a,r)=>!a||r.load>a.load?r:a,null);
    const e1=withLoad.reduce((a,r)=>Math.max(a,r.load*(1+(r.reps||1)/30)),0);
    const last=rows[rows.length-1];
    return `<tr><td>${esc(g[n].name)}</td><td class="num">${best?best.load+" × "+(best.reps||"?"):"—"}</td><td class="num">${e1?Math.round(e1):"—"}</td><td class="num">${fmtShort(idxOf(last.iso))}</td><td class="num">${rows.length}</td></tr>`}).join("")}</tbody></table></div>`;
}
function benchTable(){
  const b=getWeek(0), r=getWeek(18);
  const rows=[1,2,3].map(k=>`<tr><td>${esc(b["b"+k+"n"]||"Benchmark "+k)}</td><td>${esc(b["b"+k+"r"]||"—")}</td><td>${esc(r["r"+k]||"—")}</td></tr>`).join("");
  return `<div class="tw"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Benchmark</th><th>Baseline</th><th>Week 18</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows}</tbody></table></div>`;
}

/* =========================================================
   PROGRESS
   ========================================================= */
function viewProgress(){
  const sub=seg("prog",ui.prog,[["overview","Overview"],["checkin","Check-in"],["baseline","Baseline"],["final","Final"]]);
  const body= ui.prog==="checkin"?viewCheckin(): ui.prog==="baseline"?viewBaseline(): ui.prog==="final"?viewFinal(): viewOverview();
  return `<div class="pagehead"><h1>Progress</h1>${syncBadge()}</div>${sub}${body}`;
}
function viewOverview(){
  const ti=idxOf(todayIso()), S=startWeight(), cur=avgRange(ti-6,ti), cw=currentWeek();
  let rows="";
  const last=Math.min(Math.max(cw,0),24);
  for(let w=0;w<=last;w++){
    const s=weekStats(w); if(!s.weights.length&&!s.logged&&!s.done) continue;
    const c=w>=1?weekChange(w).change:null; const dec=(docs["week-"+w]||{}).decision;
    rows+=`<tr data-act="ck-goto" data-w="${w}" class="clickrow"><td>${w===0?"Prep":w}</td><td class="num">${s.avgW!=null?r1(s.avgW):"—"}</td><td class="num ${c==null?"":c<=0?"good":"bad"}">${c!=null?signed(c,1):"—"}</td><td class="num">${w>=1&&w<=24?r1(onTrackAt(w)):"—"}</td><td class="num">${s.avgCal!=null?comma(s.avgCal):"—"}</td><td class="num">${s.avgP!=null?Math.round(s.avgP):"—"}</td><td class="num">${w>=1?s.done+"/"+s.planned:"—"}</td><td>${dec?esc(shortDec(dec)):""}</td></tr>`;
  }
  const onTrack = cw>=1&&cw<=24&&cur!=null ? (cur<=onTrackAt(cw)) : null;
  return `
  <div class="stats3">
    <div class="stat"><b>${r1(S)}</b><span>Start${weekStats(0).weights.length?" (prep avg)":" (plan)"}</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b>${cur!=null?r1(cur):"—"}</b><span>Last 7-day avg</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b class="${cur==null?"":S-cur>=0?"good":"bad"}">${cur!=null?signed(cur-S,1):"—"}</b><span>Change</span></div>
  </div>
  ${onTrack!=null?`<div class="banner ${onTrack?"calm":""}">Week ${cw}: ${onTrack?"on track":"above the on-track line"} (at or below ${r1(onTrackAt(cw))} lb). Projected average ${r1(projW(cw))}.</div>`:""}
  <section class="card"><h2>Weight vs. the plan</h2>${weightChart()}
    <div class="legend2"><span><i class="lg-dot"></i>Morning weight</span><span><i class="lg-avg"></i>7-day average</span><span><i class="lg-proj"></i>Projection</span><span><i class="lg-band"></i>On track</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Weekly summary</h2>
  ${rows?`<div class="tw"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Wk</th><th class="num">Avg</th><th class="num">Δ</th><th class="num">On track ≤</th><th class="num">Cal</th><th class="num">P</th><th class="num">Sess</th><th>Decision</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows}</tbody></table></div><p class="hint">Tap a row to open that week's check-in. Week 14 compares with Week 12.</p>`:`<p class="hint">Log weigh-ins and food on Today and your weekly numbers appear here.</p>`}
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Measurements (inches)</h2>${measureTable()}</section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Benchmarks</h2>${benchTable()}</section>`;
}
function shortDec(k){return {none:"No change",add100:"+100 cal",fixlog:"Fix logging",slow1:"No change",walk:"+20 min walk",cut100:"−100 cal",special:"Scheduled"}[k]||""}
function measureTable(){
  const cols=[0,4,8,12,16,20], M=[["waist","Waist"],["chest","Chest"],["hips","Hips"],["arm","Upper arm"],["thigh","Thigh"]];
  const head=cols.map(c=>`<th class="num">${c===0?"Base":"Wk "+c}</th>`).join("");
  const body=M.map(m=>{
    const vals=cols.map(c=>num(getWeek(c)[m[0]]));
    const first=vals.find(v=>v!=null), lastv=[...vals].reverse().find(v=>v!=null);
    return `<tr><td>${m[1]}</td>${vals.map(v=>`<td class="num">${v!=null?v:"—"}</td>`).join("")}<td class="num ${first!=null&&lastv!=null?(lastv-first<=0?"good":"bad"):""}">${first!=null&&lastv!=null&&vals.filter(v=>v!=null).length>1?signed(lastv-first,1):"—"}</td></tr>`}).join("");
  return `<div class="tw"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Measure</th>${head}<th class="num">Change</th></tr></thead><tbody>${body}</tbody></table></div><p class="hint">A waist that keeps shrinking while the scale stalls still counts as progress.</p>`;
}
function weightChart(){
  const W=360,H=240,L=34,R=8,T=12,B=26;
  let lastIdx=LAST; for(let i=LAST+1;i<=SHOW_LAST;i++) if(weightAt(i)!=null) lastIdx=i;
  const pts=[];for(let i=PREP_FROM;i<=lastIdx;i++){const w=weightAt(i);if(w!=null)pts.push([i,w])}
  const S=startWeight();
  const PR=projections(), M=tset().margin, lastW=Math.min(24,Math.floor(lastIdx/7)+1);
  const projPts=[[-1,PR[0]]];for(let k=1;k<=lastW;k++)projPts.push([(k-1)*7+6,PR[k]]);
  const allY=pts.map(p=>p[1]).concat(projPts.map(p=>p[1]),[S]);
  let lo=Math.floor(Math.min.apply(null,allY)-1), hi=Math.ceil(Math.max.apply(null,allY.concat(projPts.map(p=>p[1]+M)))+1);
  const x=i=>L+(i-PREP_FROM)/(lastIdx-PREP_FROM)*(W-L-R), y=v=>T+(hi-v)/(hi-lo)*(H-T-B);
  let g="";
  const step=(hi-lo)>16?4:2;
  for(let v=Math.ceil(lo/step)*step;v<=hi;v+=step) g+=`<line x1="${L}" x2="${W-R}" y1="${y(v).toFixed(1)}" y2="${y(v).toFixed(1)}" class="c-grid"/><text x="${L-5}" y="${(y(v)+3.5).toFixed(1)}" text-anchor="end" class="c-lab">${v}</text>`;
  g+=`<rect x="${x(84).toFixed(1)}" y="${T}" width="${(x(91)-x(84)).toFixed(1)}" height="${H-T-B}" class="c-break"/><text x="${((x(84)+x(91))/2).toFixed(1)}" y="${T+9}" text-anchor="middle" class="c-lab sm">break</text>`;
  [["Oct",-4],["Nov",27],["Dec",57],["Jan",88],["Feb",119],["Mar",147]].forEach(m=>{if(m[1]<=lastIdx&&m[1]>=PREP_FROM)g+=`<text x="${(x(m[1])+2).toFixed(1)}" y="${H-8}" class="c-lab">${m[0]}</text><line x1="${x(m[1]).toFixed(1)}" x2="${x(m[1]).toFixed(1)}" y1="${H-B}" y2="${H-B+4}" class="c-axis"/>`});
  Object.keys(HOLIDAYS).forEach(k=>{const i=idxOf(k);g+=`<line x1="${x(i).toFixed(1)}" x2="${x(i).toFixed(1)}" y1="${T}" y2="${H-B}" class="c-hol"/>`});
  let up="",dn="";projPts.forEach(p=>{up+=`${x(p[0]).toFixed(1)},${y(p[1]+M).toFixed(1)} `;dn=`${x(p[0]).toFixed(1)},${y(p[1]).toFixed(1)} `+dn});
  g+=`<polygon points="${up}${dn}" class="c-band"/>`;
  g+=`<polyline points="${projPts.map(p=>x(p[0]).toFixed(1)+","+y(p[1]).toFixed(1)).join(" ")}" class="c-proj"/>`;
  const ti=idxOf(todayIso()); if(ti>=PREP_FROM&&ti<=lastIdx) g+=`<line x1="${x(ti).toFixed(1)}" x2="${x(ti).toFixed(1)}" y1="${T}" y2="${H-B}" class="c-today"/>`;
  pts.forEach(p=>{g+=`<circle cx="${x(p[0]).toFixed(1)}" cy="${y(p[1]).toFixed(1)}" r="2.3" class="c-dot"/>`});
  let path="";pts.forEach((p,k)=>{const a=avgRange(Math.max(PREP_FROM,p[0]-6),p[0]);path+=(k?"L":"M")+x(p[0]).toFixed(1)+","+y(a).toFixed(1)});
  if(pts.length>1) g+=`<path d="${path}" class="c-avg"/>`;
  return `<svg viewBox="0 0 ${W} ${H}" class="chart" role="img" aria-label="Weight trend against the projection">${g}</svg>`;
}
function viewCheckin(){
  const w=ui.ckWeek, wk=getWeek(w), s=weekStats(w), r=weekRange(w);
  const nav=`<div class="dnav">
    <button class="arrow" data-act="ck-prev" ${w<=0?"disabled":""} aria-label="Previous week">‹</button>
    <div class="dmid"><div class="dtitle">${w===0?"Prep week":"Week "+w} check-in</div><div class="dsub">${rangeLabel(w)}${phaseOf(w)?" · "+esc(phaseOf(w).name):""}</div></div>
    <button class="arrow" data-act="ck-next" ${w>=24?"disabled":""} aria-label="Next week">›</button></div>`;
  if(w===0) return nav+`<div class="banner calm">The prep week has no check-in. Your baseline is on the <button class="linkbtn" data-act="go-prog" data-v="baseline">Baseline</button> page.</div>`;
  const c=weekChange(w), sug=suggestDecision(w), chosen=wk.decision||null;
  const kv=[
    ["7-day average weight", s.avgW!=null?r1(s.avgW)+" lb":"—", s.weights.length+" weigh-ins"],
    ["Week "+compareWeek(w)+" average", c.b.avgW!=null?r1(c.b.avgW)+" lb":"—",""],
    ["Change", c.change!=null?signed(c.change,1)+" lb":"—", w===13?"diet break: ignore":""],
    ["On track at or below", w<=24?r1(onTrackAt(w))+" lb":"—", w<=24?"projection "+r1(projW(w)):""],
    ["Days logged", s.logged+" / 7",""],
    ["Days within "+tset().tol+" cal of target", s.within+" / 7",""],
    ["Days protein "+tset().protFloor+" g or more", s.prot+" / 7",""],
    ["Sessions completed", s.done+" / "+s.planned, s.hard?s.hard+" at RPE 8+":""],
    trk("sleep")?["Average sleep", s.avgSleep!=null?r1(s.avgSleep)+" h":"—",""]:null,
    trk("energy")?["Average energy", s.avgEnergy!=null?r1(s.avgEnergy)+" / 5":"—",""]:null,
    trk("steps")?["Average steps", s.avgSteps!=null?comma(s.avgSteps):"—",""]:null,
    ["Any joint pain", s.kneePain?"Yes":"No",""]
  ].filter(Boolean);
  const showRec = w>=8&&w<=17&&w!==12;
  const rc = showRec?recoveryCheck(w):null;
  const decOpts = sug.key==="special" ? ["special"] : ["none","add100","fixlog","slow1","walk","cut100"];
  return nav+`
  <p class="hint center">Do this Sunday morning after the weigh-in. Change one thing at most.</p>
  <section class="card"><h2>The numbers</h2>
    <table class="kv">${kv.map(k=>`<tr><td>${k[0]}</td><td class="num"><b>${k[1]}</b>${k[2]?`<small>${esc(k[2])}</small>`:""}</td></tr>`).join("")}</table>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Decision for next week</h2>
    <div class="suggest"><span class="muted small">Suggested by the decision table</span><p>${sug.key==="special"?`<b>${esc(SPECIAL[w])}</b>`:`${sug.key?`<b>${esc(DECISIONS[sug.key].label)}</b><br>`:""}<span class="small">${esc(sug.why)}</span>`}</p></div>
    ${w<=20?`<div class="decs">${decOpts.map(k=>`<button class="dec ${chosen===k?"on":""}" data-act="decide" data-v="${k}"><i></i><span>${esc(k==="special"?SPECIAL[w]:DECISIONS[k].label)}${sug.key===k?` <em>suggested</em>`:""}</span></button>`).join("")}</div>
    ${chosen?`<button class="linkbtn" data-act="decide" data-v="">Clear decision</button>`:""}
    <p class="hint">Calorie decisions carry forward to every later week's targets. Floors: 1,900 training, 1,600 rest.</p>`:
    `<button class="btn ${settings().maintLock===w?"":"ghost"} full" data-act="lock-maint" data-w="${w}">${settings().maintLock===w?"Maintenance locked at this week's targets":"Lock this week's targets as maintenance"}</button>`}
  </section>
  ${rc?`<section class="card"><h2>Recovery check: is Thursday hard next week?</h2>
    <ul class="cl">${rc.items.map(x=>`<li class="${x[1]?"y":""}"><i>${x[1]?"✓":""}</i>${x[0]} <small class="muted">${esc(x[2])}</small></li>`).join("")}</ul>
    <p class="small"><b>${rc.pass?"All checks passed: Thursday next week is RPE 8–9.":"Not all passed: Thursday next week stays at RPE 7."}</b></p>${rc.skipped.length?`<p class="hint">You're not tracking ${rc.skipped.join(" or ")}, so ${rc.skipped.length>1?"those checks are":"that check is"} skipped. Judge them yourself before a hard Thursday.</p>`:""}</section>`:""}
  ${MEASURE_WEEKS.includes(w)||wk.showMeasure||wk.waist!=null?measureCard(w,wk):`<p class="hint center">Measurements are due in Weeks 4, 8, 12, 16, and 20. <button class="linkbtn" data-act="show-measure" data-w="${w}">Add them this week anyway</button></p>`}
  ${w===18?`<section class="card"><h2>Benchmark retest</h2>${[1,2,3].map(k=>field(esc(getWeek(0)["b"+k+"n"]||"Benchmark "+k),"w:r"+k,wk["r"+k],{type:"text",week:18,ph:"result"})).join("")}</section>`:""}
  <section class="card"><h2>Reflection</h2>
    <label class="lab">What went well</label><textarea class="inp" rows="2" data-bind="w:well" data-week="${w}">${esc(wk.well||"")}</textarea>
    <label class="lab">What got in the way</label><textarea class="inp" rows="2" data-bind="w:obstacle" data-week="${w}">${esc(wk.obstacle||"")}</textarea>
    <label class="lab">Next week I will</label><textarea class="inp" rows="2" data-bind="w:next" data-week="${w}">${esc(wk.next||"")}</textarea>
  </section>`;
}
function measureCard(w,wk){
  return `<section class="card"><h2>Measurements (Sunday morning, inches)</h2>
    <div class="grid3">
      ${field("Waist at navel","w:waist",wk.waist,{week:w,step:"0.25"})}
      ${field("Chest","w:chest",wk.chest,{week:w,step:"0.25"})}
      ${field("Hips","w:hips",wk.hips,{week:w,step:"0.25"})}
      ${field("Upper arm","w:arm",wk.arm,{week:w,step:"0.25"})}
      ${field("Thigh","w:thigh",wk.thigh,{week:w,step:"0.25"})}
      ${w===0&&trk("watch")?field("Resting HR","w:rhr",wk.rhr,{week:w,im:"numeric",ph:"watch 7-day avg"}):""}
    </div>
    <label class="lab">Photos</label>
    <div class="chiprow">${[["photoF","Front"],["photoS","Side"],["photoB","Back"]].map(p=>`<label class="chk"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="w:${p[0]}" data-week="${w}" ${wk[p[0]]||(wk.photos&&!("photoF" in wk))?"checked":""}> ${p[1]}</label>`).join("")}</div>
    <p class="hint">Same tape, same spots, same light, time, and clothes every time.</p>
  </section>`;
}
function viewBaseline(){
  const b=getWeek(0), s=weekStats(0);
  let wts="";for(let i=-7;i<0;i++){const v=weightAt(i);wts+=`<button class="bw" data-act="goto-day" data-iso="${isoOf(i)}" data-tab="today"><span>${DOW[dowOf(i)]}</span><b>${v!=null?r1(v):"—"}</b></button>`}
  return `<p class="hint center">Prep week: ${rangeLabel(0)}</p>
  <section class="card"><h2>Morning weights (lb)</h2><div class="bws">${wts}</div>
    <p class="small">Starting weight (average): <b>${s.weights.length?r1(s.avgW):"—"}</b>${s.weights.length?" from "+s.weights.length+" weigh-ins":". Weigh in Tuesday through Sunday; tap a day to log it."}</p></section>
  ${measureCard(0,b)}
  <section class="card"><h2>Benchmarks to retest in Week 18</h2>
    ${[1,2,3].map(k=>`<div class="bench"><div class="grid2">${field("Benchmark "+k,"w:b"+k+"n",b["b"+k+"n"],{type:"text",week:0,ph:k===1?"box benchmark WOD":k===2?"3RM deadlift or strict press":"max strict pull-ups"})}${field("Result","w:b"+k+"r",b["b"+k+"r"],{type:"text",week:0})}</div>${field("Date","w:b"+k+"d",b["b"+k+"d"],{type:"date",week:0})}</div>`).join("")}
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Prep checklist</h2>
    ${PREP_TASKS.map(t=>check("w:prep_"+t[0],b["prep_"+t[0]],t[1],t[2],0)).join("")}
  </section>`;
}
function viewFinal(){
  const f=getFinal(), b=getWeek(0), w20=getWeek(20), r18=getWeek(18);
  const w20s=weekStats(20), base=startWeight();
  const rows=[
    ["Weight, 7-day average (lb)", r1(base), w20s.avgW!=null?r1(w20s.avgW):"—", w20s.avgW!=null?signed(w20s.avgW-base,1):"—"],
    ...[["waist","Waist (in)"],["chest","Chest (in)"],["hips","Hips (in)"],["arm","Upper arm (in)"],["thigh","Thigh (in)"]].map(m=>{const a=num(b[m[0]]),z=num(w20[m[0]]);return [m[1],a??"—",z??"—",a!=null&&z!=null?signed(z-a,1):"—"]}),
    ...[1,2,3].map(k=>[esc(b["b"+k+"n"]||"Benchmark "+k),esc(b["b"+k+"r"]||"—"),esc(r18["r"+k]||"—"),""]),
    trk("sleep")?["Average sleep (h)", weekStats(1).avgSleep!=null?r1(weekStats(1).avgSleep):"—", weekStats(20).avgSleep!=null?r1(weekStats(20).avgSleep):"—",""]:null
  ].filter(Boolean);
  let mrows="";for(let w=21;w<=24;w++){const t=weekTargets(w),s=weekStats(w);mrows+=`<tr><td>${w}</td><td class="num">${comma(t.train)}</td><td class="num">${comma(t.rest)}</td><td class="num">${s.avgW!=null?r1(s.avgW):"—"}</td></tr>`}
  return `<p class="hint center">Sunday, February 21, 2027, after Week 20</p>
  <section class="card"><h2>Start vs. finish</h2><div class="tw"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Measure</th><th class="num">Baseline</th><th class="num">Week 20</th><th class="num">Change</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(r=>`<tr><td>${r[0]}</td><td class="num">${r[1]}</td><td class="num">${r[2]}</td><td class="num">${r[3]}</td></tr>`).join("")}</tbody></table></div></section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Finding maintenance</h2><p class="hint">Add 100 cal/day each week until the average holds within about 0.5 lb for two weeks. Lock it in from that week's check-in.</p>
    <div class="tw"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Week</th><th class="num">Training</th><th class="num">Rest</th><th class="num">7-day avg</th></tr></thead><tbody>${mrows}</tbody></table></div></section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Review</h2>
    ${["worked:What worked best","keep:What I will keep doing","maint:New maintenance calories","next:Next goal"].map(x=>{const p=x.split(":");return `<label class="lab">${p[1]}</label><textarea class="inp" rows="2" data-bind="f:${p[0]}">${esc(f[p[0]]||"")}</textarea>`}).join("")}
  </section>`;
}

/* =========================================================
   PLAN
   ========================================================= */
function viewPlan(){
  if(ui.plan==="calendar") ui.plan="targets";
  const sub=seg("plan",ui.plan,[["week","Week"],["targets","Targets"],["meals","Meals"],["rules","Rules"],["settings","Settings"]]);
  const body= ui.plan==="targets"?viewTargets(): ui.plan==="meals"?viewMeals(): ui.plan==="rules"?viewRules(): ui.plan==="settings"?viewSettings(): viewWeek();
  return `<div class="pagehead"><h1>Plan</h1>${syncBadge()}</div>${sub}${body}`;
}
function viewWeek(){
  const w=ui.planWeek, ph=phaseOf(w), t=weekTargets(w), r=weekRange(w), notes=weekNotes(w);
  let rows="";
  for(let i=r[0];i<=r[1];i++){
    const p=planDay(i), rt=rpeTarget(i), tg=targetFor(i,{type:p.type}), hol=HOLIDAYS[isoOf(i)];
    rows+=`<tr data-act="goto-day" data-iso="${isoOf(i)}" data-tab="today" class="clickrow ${isoOf(i)===todayIso()?"cur":""}"><td><b>${DOW[dowOf(i)]}</b> <span class="muted">${fmtDate(i,{day:"numeric"})}</span></td><td>${p.type==="R"?"Rest":"CrossFit"}</td><td>${p.type==="R"?"":esc(p.rpe==="8-9*"?"8–9*":p.rpe.replace("-","–"))}</td><td>${p.type==="F"?"Refeed":p.type==="T"?"Training":"Rest"}</td><td class="num">${tg.cal!=null?comma(tg.cal):"—"}</td><td class="small">${esc(hol?hol+": holiday rule":p.extra)}</td></tr>`;
  }
  return `<div class="dnav">
    <button class="arrow" data-act="pw-prev" ${w<=0?"disabled":""} aria-label="Previous week">‹</button>
    <div class="dmid"><div class="dtitle">${w===0?"Prep week":"Week "+w}</div><div class="dsub">${rangeLabel(w)}</div></div>
    <button class="arrow" data-act="pw-next" ${w>=24?"disabled":""} aria-label="Next week">›</button></div>
  ${ph?`<section class="card"><h2>${esc(ph.name)}</h2><p>${esc(ph.goal)}</p><button class="linkbtn" data-act="guide-to" data-v="${ph.sec}">Read the full phase page</button></section>`:""}
  <section class="card"><h2>Targets</h2>
    <div class="tchips"><span><b>${comma(t.train)}</b> training</span><span><b>${comma(t.rest)}</b> rest</span>${t.refeed?`<span><b>${comma(t.refeed)}</b> Sat refeed</span>`:""}<span><b>${tset().protLo}–${tset().protHi} g</b> protein (min ${tset().protFloor})</span>${trk("steps")?`<span><b>${comma(t.stepGoal||7000)}+</b> steps</span>`:""}</div>
    ${t.custom?`<p class="hint">Custom targets for this week (plan: ${comma(t.plan.train)} / ${comma(t.plan.rest)}${t.plan.refeed?" / "+comma(t.plan.refeed):""}). Change them in <button class="linkbtn" data-act="plan" data-v="targets">Targets</button>.</p>`:`<p class="hint"><button class="linkbtn" data-act="plan" data-v="targets">Change targets</button></p>`}
    ${t.adj?`<p class="hint">Includes ${signed(t.adj)} cal/day from your check-in decisions.</p>`:""}${t.practice?`<p class="hint">Prep week numbers are for practice logging only.</p>`:""}
    ${w>=1&&w<=24?`<p class="small">Projected average ${r1(projW(w))} lb · on track at or below ${r1(onTrackAt(w))} lb</p>`:""}
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Week at a glance</h2>
    <div class="tw"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>Day</th><th>Session</th><th>RPE</th><th>Nutrition</th><th class="num">Cal</th><th>Also</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows}</tbody></table></div>
    ${r[0]>=0&&weekPlan(w).some(d=>d.rpe==="8-9*")?`<p class="hint">* Thursday is hard only if the previous Sunday's recovery check passed.</p>`:""}
  </section>
  ${notes.length?`<section class="card"><h2>Notes</h2><ul class="plain">${notes.map(n=>`<li>${esc(n)}</li>`).join("")}</ul></section>`:""}
  ${weekChecklist(w)}`;
}
function weekChecklist(w){
  const items={
    p1:["Weigh and log everything, every day (Weeks 1 to 3)","Morning weigh-in every day","Tell your coach about the RPE plan and your knee (start of Week 1)","Sunday check-in every week","Week 4 Sunday: measurements and photos"],
    p2:["Tuesday and Saturday at RPE 8 to 9; all others at RPE 7","Saturday refeed, weighed and logged","Sunday check-in every week","Thanksgiving (Week 8): holiday-day rule, back on plan Friday","Week 8 Sunday: measurements and photos"],
    p3:["Recovery check every Sunday to decide Thursday's intensity","Christmas (Week 12): holiday-day rule","If the trend stalls two weeks: weigh everything for one week","Week 12 Sunday: measurements and photos"],
    db:["Every day at the diet-break target, logged","Protein at 140 g or more every day","New Year's Eve and Day: holiday-day rule","No check-in adjustment this week"],
    p4:["Week 14: compare with Week 12, not Week 13","Recovery check every Sunday","Week 16 Sunday: measurements and photos"],
    p5:["Week 18: retest all three baseline benchmarks","Weeks 19 and 20: only Saturday is hard","Week 20 Sunday: final measurements and photos","Fill in the Final review"]
  };
  const ph=phaseOf(w); if(!ph||!items[ph.key]) return "";
  const all=items[ph.key].concat(["Sleep: 7.5 hours in bed, fixed wake time","Steps: 7,000 or more daily; 30 to 45 minute walk on rest days","Creatine 5 g and multivitamin daily"]);
  return `<section class="card"><h2>Phase checklist</h2><ul class="plain dots">${all.map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join("")}</ul></section>`;
}
function viewTargets(){
  const cw=currentWeek(), P=tset(), S=settings(), fromW=clamp(ui.bulkFrom||Math.max(cw,1),1,24);
  let rows="";
  for(let w=1;w<=24;w++){
    const t=weekTargets(w), ov=S.overrides[w]||{}, ph=phaseOf(w), s=weekStats(w);
    const ev=[];if(w===8)ev.push("Thanksgiving");if(w===12)ev.push("Christmas");if(w===13)ev.push("New Year");if(MEASURE_WEEKS.includes(w))ev.push("Measure");if(w===18)ev.push("Retest");
    const cell=(k)=>`<input class="tin ${num(ov[k])!=null?"set":""}" data-bind="o:${w}:${k}" type="number" inputmode="numeric" step="50" placeholder="${t.plan[k]!=null?t.plan[k]:"—"}" value="${num(ov[k])!=null?ov[k]:""}" aria-label="Week ${w} ${k} calories">`;
    rows+=`<tr class="${w===cw?"cur":""}"><td><button class="linkbtn wk" data-act="pw-goto" data-w="${w}">${w}</button><small>${esc(ph.key==="maint"?"Maint.":ph.name.split(":")[0].replace("Phase ","P"))}</small></td>
      <td>${cell("train")}</td><td>${cell("rest")}</td><td>${cell("refeed")}</td>
      <td class="num" data-live="proj" data-w="${w}"></td><td class="num">${s.avgW!=null?r1(s.avgW):""}</td>
      <td>${ov.train!=null||ov.rest!=null||ov.refeed!=null?`<button class="ib sm" data-act="ov-reset" data-w="${w}" aria-label="Reset week ${w} to plan">↺</button>`:""}</td></tr>
      ${ev.length?`<tr class="evrow"><td></td><td colspan="6">${rangeLabel(w)} · ${ev.join(", ")}</td></tr>`:`<tr class="evrow"><td></td><td colspan="6">${rangeLabel(w)}</td></tr>`}`;
  }
  const kgFloor=Math.round(1.6*startWeight()/2.2046), kgHi=Math.round(2.2*startWeight()/2.2046);
  return `<section class="card"><h2>Daily targets</h2>
    <div class="grid3">
      ${field("Protein floor (g)","t:protFloor",P.protFloor,{im:"numeric"})}
      ${field("Aim from (g)","t:protLo",P.protLo,{im:"numeric"})}
      ${field("Aim to (g)","t:protHi",P.protHi,{im:"numeric"})}
      ${field("Calorie window ±","t:tol",P.tol,{im:"numeric"})}
      ${field("Fiber (g)","t:fiber",P.fiber,{im:"numeric"})}
      ${trk("fluids")?field("Fluids (oz)","t:fluids",P.fluids,{im:"numeric"}):""}
    </div>
    <p class="hint">The guide's protein range for keeping muscle in a deficit is 1.6–2.2 g/kg, about ${kgFloor}–${kgHi} g at your start weight. Everything that grades protein uses these numbers.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Change calories for many weeks</h2>
    <div class="grid2"><div class="fld"><label>Starting week</label><select class="inp" data-act-change="bulk-from">${Array.from({length:24},(_,k)=>k+1).map(w=>`<option value="${w}" ${w===fromW?"selected":""}>Week ${w} (${fmtShort(weekRange(w)[0])})</option>`).join("")}</select></div>
    <div class="fld"><label>Through</label><select class="inp" data-act-change="bulk-to">${[20,24].map(w=>`<option value="${w}" ${(ui.bulkTo||20)===w?"selected":""}>Week ${w}</option>`).join("")}</select></div></div>
    <div class="grid3">
      <div class="fld"><label>Training</label><input class="inp" id="bk-train" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="keep"></div>
      <div class="fld"><label>Rest</label><input class="inp" id="bk-rest" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="keep"></div>
      <div class="fld"><label>Refeed</label><input class="inp" id="bk-refeed" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="keep"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid2"><button class="btn" data-act="bulk-set">Set these numbers</button><button class="btn ghost" data-act="bulk-shift">Shift the plan by these</button></div>
    <p class="hint">"Set" makes every week in the range exactly these numbers (blank fields stay as they are). "Shift" adds the amounts to the plan's numbers, so the diet break and step-ups keep their shape. Use negative numbers to lower. Floors in the guide: 1,900 training, 1,600 rest.</p>
    <button class="linkbtn" data-act="ov-reset-all">Reset every week to the plan</button>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Week by week</h2>
    <p class="hint">Type in any cell to override that week. Gray numbers are the plan (including check-in adjustments). Projections update as you type.</p>
    <div class="tw"><table class="tbl ttable"><thead><tr><th>Wk</th><th>Train</th><th>Rest</th><th>Refeed</th><th class="num">Proj.</th><th class="num">Actual</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows}</tbody></table></div>
    <div data-live="projsum" class="small"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Projection settings</h2>
    <div class="grid3">
      ${field("Rest-day burn","t:burnRest",P.burnRest,{im:"numeric"})}
      ${field("Training-day burn","t:burnTrain",P.burnTrain,{im:"numeric"})}
      ${field("On-track margin (lb)","t:margin",P.margin,{step:"0.5"})}
    </div>
    <p class="hint">The projection starts at your prep-week average (or 186), uses 3,500 cal per lb, and lowers burn by 7 cal/day for each pound lost, like the guide. If the Sunday check-ins show you losing faster or slower than projected, adjust the burn numbers.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Phases</h2>${PHASES.filter(p=>p.key!=="prep").map(p=>`<div class="phase-row"><b>${esc(p.name)}</b> <span class="muted small">${p.key==="maint"?"Week 21 on":p.weeks[0]===p.weeks[1]?"Week "+p.weeks[0]:"Weeks "+p.weeks[0]+"–"+p.weeks[1]}</span><p class="small">${esc(p.goal)}</p></div>`).join("")}</section>`;
}
live.proj=function(el){const w=Number(el.dataset.w);return r1(projW(w))};
live.projsum=function(){const PR=projections(),S=PR[0];return `Projected Week 20 average: <b>${r1(PR[20])} lb</b> (${signed(PR[20]-S,1)} from ${r1(S)}). The guide's plan projects 173.0.`};
function portionFix(diff){
  if(Math.abs(diff)<40) return "";
  const more=diff>0, a=Math.abs(diff);
  return `<p class="banner calm small">Your target is ${comma(a)} cal ${more?"above":"below"} these portions. At dinner, ${more?"add":"use"} about <b>${Math.round(a/1.3/5)*5} g ${more?"more":"less"} cooked rice</b> or <b>${Math.round(a/0.87/5)*5} g ${more?"more":"less"} potato</b>${!more&&a>250?", or drop the lunch oil (88 cal) as well":""}.</p>`;
}
function viewMeals(){
  const w=Math.max(ui.planWeek,0), t=weekTargets(w);
  const types=[["T","Training"],["R","Rest"]]; if(t.refeed) types.push(["F","Refeed"]);
  let mt=ui.mealType||"T"; if(mt==="F"&&!t.refeed) mt="T";
  const key=mt==="T"?t.tkey:mt==="F"?t.fkey:t.rkey, cal=mt==="T"?t.train:mt==="F"?t.refeed:t.rest;
  const meals=variantMeals(key,mt==="R"?"R":"T");
  let tot=[0,0,0,0];meals.forEach(m=>{for(let j=0;j<4;j++)tot[j]+=m.opts[0].total[j]});
  return `<div class="dnav"><button class="arrow" data-act="pw-prev" ${w<=0?"disabled":""} aria-label="Previous week">‹</button><div class="dmid"><div class="dtitle">${w===0?"Prep week":"Week "+w} meals</div><div class="dsub">${rangeLabel(w)}</div></div><button class="arrow" data-act="pw-next" ${w>=24?"disabled":""} aria-label="Next week">›</button></div>
  ${seg("mealtype",mt,types)}
  <section class="card"><h2>${mt==="T"?"Training day":mt==="F"?"Saturday refeed":"Rest day"}: ${comma(cal)} cal target</h2>
    <p class="small">All Option A: <b>${comma(tot[0])}</b> cal · ${tot[1]} g protein · ${tot[2]} g carbs · ${tot[3]} g fat</p>
    ${portionFix(cal-tot[0])}
    <p class="hint">Weights are cooked unless noted (oats dry, whey powder). Options within a meal are interchangeable. Highlighted rows changed for this phase.</p>
  </section>
  ${meals.map(m=>`<section class="card"><h2>${esc(m.meal)} <span class="muted small">${esc(m.time)}</span></h2>
    ${m.opts.map((o,oi)=>`<div class="opt"><div class="opth">${m.opts.length>1?"Option "+(oi?"B":"A")+": ":""}${esc(o.name)}<span class="num">${comma(o.total[0])} cal · ${o.total[1]} P</span></div>
    <div class="tw"><table class="tbl meal"><thead><tr><th>Food</th><th>Amount</th><th class="num">Cal</th><th class="num">P</th><th class="num">C</th><th class="num">F</th></tr></thead><tbody>${o.foods.map(f=>`<tr class="${o.changed&&/rice|Potato|Peanut/.test(f[0])&&VARIANTS[key].some(c=>f[0].indexOf(c[1])===0)?"chg":""}"><td>${esc(f[0])}</td><td>${esc(f[1])}</td><td class="num">${f[2]}</td><td class="num">${f[3]}</td><td class="num">${f[4]}</td><td class="num">${f[5]}</td></tr>`).join("")}</tbody></table></div></div>`).join("")}
  </section>`).join("")}
  <p class="hint center">Swaps for protein, starch, fat, and produce: <button class="linkbtn" data-act="guide-to" data-v="s20">Food swaps</button> · Family meals and oil: <button class="linkbtn" data-act="guide-to" data-v="s17">Weighing guide</button></p>`;
}
function cloneSection(id){
  const tpl=document.getElementById("guide-src"); if(!tpl) return "";
  const el=tpl.content.getElementById?tpl.content.getElementById(id):tpl.content.querySelector("#"+id);
  if(!el) return "";
  const c=el.cloneNode(true); c.removeAttribute("id");
  c.querySelectorAll("[id]").forEach(n=>n.removeAttribute("id"));
  c.querySelectorAll("sup.cite").forEach(n=>n.remove());
  const div=document.createElement("div");div.appendChild(c);return div.innerHTML;
}
function viewRules(){
  return `<div class="guide inline">${cloneSection("s12")}${cloneSection("s15")}${cloneSection("s14")}${cloneSection("s21")}${cloneSection("s22")}</div>
  <p class="hint center">Full research and plan in the <button class="linkbtn" data-act="go-tab" data-v="guide">Guide</button>.</p>`;
}
function viewSettings(){
  const s=settings(), th=themePrefs();
  return `<section class="card"><h2>Appearance</h2>
    <label class="lab">Mode</label>${seg("theme-mode",th.mode,[["auto","Auto"],["light","Light"],["dark","Dark"]])}
    <label class="lab">Earth palette</label>
    <div class="palettes">${[["moss","Moss"],["clay","Clay"],["stone","Stone"],["cedar","Cedar"]].map(p=>`<button class="pal pal-${p[0]} ${th.palette===p[0]?"on":""}" data-act="palette" data-v="${p[0]}"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>${p[1]}</span></button>`).join("")}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>What you track</h2>
    <p class="hint">Weigh-ins, food, and workouts are always on. Turn on anything else you want to log; everything that grades or summarizes adjusts to match.</p>
    ${[["routine","Routine checkboxes","Creatine, multivitamin, electrolytes, shake, rest-day walk"],["sleep","Sleep","Lights out, wake time, hours"],["energy","Energy (1–5)","Used in the recovery check"],["hunger","Hunger (1–5)",""],["digestion","Digestion (Bristol scale)",""],["fluids","Fluids (oz)",""],["steps","Steps","Needs a phone or watch counter"],["watch","Watch data","Workout calories, resting heart rate"]].map(x=>check("k:"+x[0],trk(x[0]),x[1],x[2])).join("")}
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Profile</h2>
    <div class="grid2">${field("Name","s:name",s.name,{type:"text"})}${field("App used","s:appUsed",s.appUsed,{type:"text",ph:"Cronometer or MacroFactor"})}
    ${field("Fixed wake time","s:wake",s.wake,{type:"time"})}${field("Lights-out time","s:lightsOut",s.lightsOut,{type:"time"})}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Sync and backup</h2>
    <p class="small">${syncMode==="cloud"?"Your log syncs to your Claude account, so it matches on your iPhone and computer.":"Your log is saved in this browser. Open the app from its claude.ai link while signed in to sync across devices."}</p>
    <div class="grid2"><button class="btn ghost" data-act="export">Copy backup</button><button class="btn ghost" data-act="import-show">Restore backup</button></div>
    ${downloadsApi?`<button class="btn ghost full" data-act="download-csv">Download daily log (CSV)</button>`:""}
    <div id="importbox" hidden><textarea class="inp" id="importtext" rows="4" placeholder="Paste a backup here"></textarea><button class="btn full" data-act="import">Restore</button></div>
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>My foods and recipes</h2>
    ${s.customFoods.length?`<ul class="entries">${s.customFoods.map(f=>`<li><div class="en"><span class="enn">${esc(f.name)}</span><span class="env">${comma(f.cal)} cal · ${f.p} P · ${f.c} C · ${f.f} F ${f.servingOnly?"per serving":"per 100 g"}</span></div><button class="ib" data-act="del-custom" data-v="${esc(f.id)}" aria-label="Delete">✕</button></li>`).join("")}</ul>`:`<p class="hint">Foods you add from a label and recipes you save from the whole-pot calculator appear here.</p>`}
  </section>
  <section class="card"><h2>Quick-add foods</h2>
    ${s.favorites.length?`<ul class="entries">${s.favorites.map((f,k)=>`<li><div class="en"><span class="enn">${esc(f.name)}</span><span class="env">${f.cal!=null?comma(f.cal)+" cal":""}${f.p!=null?" · "+Math.round(f.p)+" P":""}</span></div><button class="ib" data-act="unfav" data-i="${k}" aria-label="Remove">✕</button></li>`).join("")}</ul>`:`<p class="hint">None yet. Tap ★ on a food entry on Today.</p>`}
  </section>
  <p class="hint center">Not medical advice. See a physician before a new program, and a PT or sports-medicine doctor about knee symptoms.</p>`;
}

/* =========================================================
   GUIDE
   ========================================================= */
function viewGuide(){
  const tpl=document.getElementById("guide-src");
  const secs=tpl?Array.from(tpl.content.querySelectorAll("section[id]")):[];
  const toc=secs.map(s=>{const h=s.querySelector("h1,h2");if(!h)return "";const major=s.classList.contains("part")||s.id==="refs";return `<button class="toc-i ${major?"major":""}" data-act="guide-to" data-v="${s.id}">${esc(h.textContent.replace(/^(\d+)/,"$1. "))}</button>`}).join("");
  return `<div class="pagehead"><h1>The Real Equation</h1></div>
  <p class="hint">The research and the 20-week plan behind this app. Every claim is cited; tap a number to jump to its reference.</p>
  <details class="toc" ${ui.guideOpen?"open":""}><summary>Contents</summary><div class="toc-list">${toc}</div></details>
  <div class="guide" id="guide-body"></div>`;
}
function mountGuide(){
  const tpl=document.getElementById("guide-src"), body=document.getElementById("guide-body");
  if(tpl&&body&&!body.childNodes.length) body.appendChild(tpl.content.cloneNode(true));
  if(ui.guideTarget){const t=document.getElementById(ui.guideTarget);ui.guideTarget=null;if(t)setTimeout(()=>{t.scrollIntoView({block:"start"})},0)}
}

